according to the amount of loss and the amount of loss shall be confiscated.', 7, 'The Prevention of Corruption Act, 2059 (2002 A.D), Section 8 (Punishment to Public Servants for Getting Illegal Benefit or Causing)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1.8', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1', 2, 'section', '9', 'Punishment to Public Servants Preparing False Documents: Whoever,', 'Punishment to Public Servants Preparing False Documents', 'being a public servant under the duty of preparing documents, prepares 
false documents with mala fide intention of causing loss to Government of 
Nepal or Government or public institution, shall be liable to a punishment 
of imprisonment for a term from three months to one year, and a fine from ten 
thousand to fifty thousand rupees.', 8, 'The Prevention of Corruption Act, 2059 (2002 A.D), Section 9 (Punishment to Public Servants Preparing False Documents)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1.9', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1', 2, 'section', '10', 'Punishment for Translating False Documents: Whoever, either a public', 'Punishment for Translating False Documents', 'servant or any other person authorized or designated to translate 
