rupees, depending on the degree of offence committed.', 9, 'The Prevention of Corruption Act, 2059 (2002 A.D), Section 10 (Punishment for Translating False Documents)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1.10', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1', 2, 'section', '11', 'Punishment for Tempering Government Documents: Whoever, either a', 'Punishment for Tempering Government Documents', 'public servant or any other person, corrects, adds, or changes in 
documents belonging to a government or public institution without 
authority or in an illegal manner, shall be liable to a punishment of 
imprisonment for a term from three months to two years and a fine not 
exceeding fifty thousands rupees.', 10, 'The Prevention of Corruption Act, 2059 (2002 A.D), Section 11 (Punishment for Tempering Government Documents)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1.11', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1', 2, 'section', '12', 'Punishment for Causing Damage to Government or Public Documents:', 'Punishment for Causing Damage to Government or Public Documents', 'Whoever, being a public servant, conceals a document belonging to 
government or to a public institution or causes damage to, or destroys, 
such document, shall be liable to a punishment of imprisonment 
from six month to one year and shall be fined from ten thousand to 
fifty thousand rupees. In case any loss is incurred due to such 
concealment, damage or destruction, the loss shall also be recovered.', 11, 'The Prevention of Corruption Act, 2059 (2002 A.D), Section 12 (Punishment for Causing Damage to Government or Public Documents)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1.12', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1', 2, 'section', '13', 'Punishment for Disclosing Secrecy of Question Papers or Altering the', 'Punishment for Disclosing Secrecy of Question Papers or Altering the', 'Result of Examination: Save in cases where the authorized person 
discloses or causes to disclose question papers of an examination to be 
conducted by a government body or a public institution before the 
prescribed time having given reasons of special circumstances, 
whoever, being a public servant, discloses or causes to disclose the secrecy 
of such question paper in any manner whatsoever, or alters or causes to 
alter the results of examinations with the intention of making illegal 
advantage to him/herself or any other person, shall be liable to a 
punishment of imprisonment from three months to one year and shall be 
fined from five thousand to ten thousand rupees.', 12, 'The Prevention of Corruption Act, 2059 (2002 A.D), Section 13 (Punishment for Disclosing Secrecy of Question Papers or Altering the)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1.13', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1', 2, 'section', '14', 'Punishment to Public Servants Engaging in Illegal Trade or Business:', 'Punishment to Public Servants Engaging in Illegal Trade or Business', 'Whoever, being a public servant, engages in trade or business in his/her 
own name or in the name of other person or in partnership with others, 
takes part in auction or bidding, or becomes a partner in any firm or 
company or a cooperative organization while being prohibited by law, shall 
be liable a punishment of imprisonment for a term from three months to 
six months and a fine from ten thousand to fifty thousand rupees, and the 
property earned in such a manner shall be confiscated. 
Provided that, this section shall not be deemed to have hindered to 
subscribe shares of a public limited company called for public subscription.', 13, 'The Prevention of Corruption Act, 2059 (2002 A.D), Section 14 (Punishment to Public Servants Engaging in Illegal Trade or Business)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1.14', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1', 2, 'section', '15', 'Punishment for Claiming False Designation: Whoever, either a public', 'Punishment for Claiming False Designation', 'servant or any other person falsely claims that he/she holds any position, 
power, capacity or facility or enjoys such position, power, capacity or facility 
of a public servant which he/she is not entitled to or displays any symbol, dress 
or mark relating to a position of a public servant or wears or displays any 
5/18/2021 The Prevention of Corruption Act, 2059 (2002 A.D) – Nepal Law Commission
https://www.lawcommission.gov.np/en/archives/category/documents/prevailing-law/statutes-acts/the-prevention-of-corruption-act-2059-2002-a-d 9/25
object resembling to such symbol, dress or mark with the intention of 
leading others to falsely believe that these are the official symbols, dresses 
or marks of a public servant, shall be liable to a punishment of
imprisonment for a term from one year to two years and with a fine from
fifty thousand to one hundred thousand rupees, depending on the degree 
of the offence committed.', 14, 'The Prevention of Corruption Act, 2059 (2002 A.D), Section 15 (Punishment for Claiming False Designation)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1.15', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1', 2, 'section', '16', 'Punishment for Giving False Particulars: (1) Whoever, with the', 'Punishment for Giving False Particulars', 'intention of securing a position of a public servant, or of being continue 
in such a position, or of securing any position or of getting any benefit or 
facility, gives false particulars regarding his educational qualifications, 
name, names of the father and grandfather, age, caste, surname, address, 
nationality or qualification, or gives false description in any other matters, 
or submits false certificate relating thereto, shall be liable to a punishment 
of imprisonment for a term from six months to one year and of a fine from 
ten thousand to twenty thousand rupees, depending on the degree of the 
offense committed. 
(2) Whoever, being a public servant under the duty of giving 
statement of his/her property under this Act or any other prevailing 
laws, gives false statement either having increased or having concealed 
the actual property belonging to or registered in his/her name or under 
his/her share entitlement or belonging to his/her joint family, shall be liable 
to a punishment of imprisonment for a term from one month to three 
months and the fine not exceeding ten thousand rupees. The property, 
which has been concealed in such a manner, shall also be confiscated.', 15, 'The Prevention of Corruption Act, 2059 (2002 A.D), Section 16 (Punishment for Giving False Particulars)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1.16', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1', 2, 'section', '17', 'Punishment for Damaging Public Property: Whoever, being a public', 'Punishment for Damaging Public Property', 'servant, misappropriates, causes loss to or abuses or causes others to do 
so, or destroys or uses for personal purposes, while performing his/her 
duties pertaining to his/her office, shall be liable to be punished pursuant 
to Section 3 and the property which has been misappropriated, damaged, 
misused or destroyed or caused others to do so, shall be recovered from him/her.', 16, 'The Prevention of Corruption Act, 2059 (2002 A.D), Section 17 (Punishment for Damaging Public Property)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1.17', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1', 2, 'section', '18', 'Punishment for Exerting Illegal Pressures: Whoever, either a public', 'Punishment for Exerting Illegal Pressures', 'servant or any other person, compels any public servant or any other 
person to commit any offence punishable urder this Act by exercise of 
fear or threat of under, kidnapping, taking away of property, of causing 
adverse impact on prestige or by exerting any other type of illegal pressure,
shall be liable to a punishment of imprisonment for a term from four to 
eight years and a fine from one hundred thousand to five hundred thousand 
rupees.', 17, 'The Prevention of Corruption Act, 2059 (2002 A.D), Section 18 (Punishment for Exerting Illegal Pressures)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1.18', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1', 2, 'section', '19', 'Punishment for Giving False Report: (1) Whoever, either a public', 'Punishment for Giving False Report', 'servant or any other person authorized to carry out auditing in a 
5/18/2021 The Prevention of Corruption Act, 2059 (2002 A.D) – Nepal Law Commission
https://www.lawcommission.gov.np/en/archives/category/documents/prevailing-law/statutes-acts/the-prevention-of-corruption-act-2059-2002-a-d 10/25
government body or in a public institution, prepares auditing report 
with mala fide intention having shown the facts not done or happened 
in the transaction or having concealed the facts done or happened, shall be 
liable to a punishment of imprisonment for a term from three months to 
one year and to a fine from ten thousand rupees to fifty thousand rupees 
depending on the degree of the offence committed. 
(2) Save as provided in Sub-section (1), in case any public 
servant or any other person under the duty of submitting report having 
conducted a study or investigation on any subject in connection with
functions of government body or public institution, prepares report with 
mala fide intention having shown the facts actually not done or 
happened or having concealed the facts actually done or happened, such 
persons shall be liable to a punishment of imprisonment for a term from 
three months to one year and to the fine from ten thousand rupees to 
fifty thousand rupees depending on the degree of the offence 
committed.', 18, 'The Prevention of Corruption Act, 2059 (2002 A.D), Section 19 (Punishment for Giving False Report)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1.19', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1', 2, 'section', '20', 'Property Deemed to be Acquired Illegally: (1) In case the statement of', 'Property Deemed to be Acquired Illegally', 'property submitted in accordance with prevailing laws by a public servant 
