seems to be incompatible or unnatural or in case he/she maintains an 
incompatible or unsuitable lifestyle or it is proved that he/she has given 
someone a donation, gift, grant, present or has lent money beyond 
his/her capacity, he/she shall prove the sources from which he/she has 
acquired such property and if he fails to do so, such property shall be 
deemed to have been acquired in an illegal manner. 
(2) In case it has been proved that a public servant has acquired property 
in an illegal manner as referred to in Sub-section (1), he/she shall be liable to a 
punishment of imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years as per the 
amount of the property acquired in such a manner, and a fine according to the 
amount of property and the illegal property acquired in such a manner shall also 
be confiscated.', 19, 'The Prevention of Corruption Act, 2059 (2002 A.D), Section 20 (Property Deemed to be Acquired Illegally)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1.20', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1', 2, 'section', '21', 'Punishment for Committing Attempts: Except otherwise provided for in', 'Punishment for Committing Attempts', 'this chapter, whoever attempts to commit an offense punishable under this Act 
shall be liable to half of the punishment to be imposed on the public servant or 
any other person committing such offences.', 20, 'The Prevention of Corruption Act, 2059 (2002 A.D), Section 21 (Punishment for Committing Attempts)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1.21', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1', 2, 'section', '22', 'Punishment to Accomplices: Except otherwise provided elsewhere in this', 'Punishment to Accomplices', 'Act, the accomplices to any offense punishable under this Act shall be liable to 
half of the punishment to be imposed on the public servant or any other person 
committing such offences. 
Provided that, the accomplice who has given cash or kind or made 
5/18/2021 The Prevention of Corruption Act, 2059 (2002 A.D) – Nepal Law Commission
https://www.lawcommission.gov.np/en/archives/category/documents/prevailing-law/statutes-acts/the-prevention-of-corruption-act-2059-2002-a-d 11/25
available any other type of benefit to the public servant or any other person 
committing an offence or who has taken such benefit shall be liable to the 
punishment as equal to the person committing the offence.', 21, 'The Prevention of Corruption Act, 2059 (2002 A.D), Section 22 (Punishment to Accomplices)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1.22', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1', 2, 'section', '23', 'Principal to be Deemed to have Committed the Offence in case a', 'Principal to be Deemed to have Committed the Offence in case a', 'Corporate Body Commits Offence: In case any firm, company or corporate 
body commits any act that is deemed to be an offence under this chapter, the 
partners at the time of commission of the act in case of a firm and the person 
acting as the principal official in case of a company or a corporate body shall be 
deemed to have committed the offence. 
Provided that, in case it is proved that such act has been committed prior to 
the appointment of the person acting as the principal official, the person who has 
committed the act shall be deemed to have committed the offence. 
Explanation: For the purpose of this Section, the “the person acting as the 
principal official” means the Chairman, Board Member, General Manager, 
Managing Director or the Official of a company or corporate body working in 
the same capacity.', 22, 'The Prevention of Corruption Act, 2059 (2002 A.D), Section 23 (Principal to be Deemed to have Committed the Offence in case a)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1.23', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1', 2, 'section', '24', 'Additional Punishment: In case the offences under this chapter have been', 'Additional Punishment', 'committed by an office bearer of a constitutional organ or body to be nominated or 
appointed by officer belonging to the special class of Government of Nepal or 
officers of equivalent rank; Head, General Manager or officer of a public 
institution of equivalent rank, such person shall be liable to the punishment of 
imprisonment for a term of three years in addition to the punishment prescribed for 
such offence
