  ('doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1.32', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1', 2, 'section', '33', 'Automatic Suspension: In case any public servant is detained pursuant to', 'Automatic Suspension', 'Clause (c) of Subsection (1) of Section 28, Sub-section (3) of Section 30 
and Section 31, he shall ipso facto be suspended until the period of 
detention and if a case is filed against him/her pursuant to Section 36, 
he/she shall ipso facto be suspended unless and until the proceedings of the case is 
over.', 32, 'The Prevention of Corruption Act, 2059 (2002 A.D), Section 33 (Automatic Suspension)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1.33', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac', 'doc_5_18_2021_the_prevention_of_corruption_act_2059_2002_a_d_nepal_law_commission_2059_prevention_of_corruption_ac:1', 2, 'section', '34', 'Accepting Services: (1) The investigating authority may, while', 'Accepting Services', 'conducting investigation, inquiries and taking any other actions 
relating thereto, require services of experts of the concerned subject or of 
