Nepal at the time of appointment.  
(4)  The code of conduct to be complied with by the  advisor 
while performing duty on that capacity shall be as prescribed.  
http://www.lawcommission.gov.np 
27 
http://www.lawcommission.gov.np', 10, 'Good Governance (Management and Operation) Act, 2064 (2008), Chapter-5, Section 34 (Advisor may be appointed)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_good_governance_management_and_operation_act__2064_good_governance_management_and_operation_act_2064_pdf:5.11', 'doc_good_governance_management_and_operation_act__2064_good_governance_management_and_operation_act_2064_pdf', 'doc_good_governance_management_and_operation_act__2064_good_governance_management_and_operation_act_2064_pdf:5', 2, 'section', '35', 'Spokesperson to be appointed : (1) Every ministry, department and', 'Spokesperson to be appointed', 'government agency and office shall appoint any of i ts officials as a 
