  ('doc_good_governance_management_and_operation_act__2064_good_governance_management_and_operation_act_2064_pdf:5.14', 'doc_good_governance_management_and_operation_act__2064_good_governance_management_and_operation_act_2064_pdf', 'doc_good_governance_management_and_operation_act__2064_good_governance_management_and_operation_act_2064_pdf:5', 2, 'section', '38', 'Monitoring and evaluation committee : (1) With the objective of', 'Monitoring and evaluation committee', 'making the service delivery system effective and tra nsforming the 
