28 
http://www.lawcommission.gov.np 
 (2) Monitoring and evaluation committee may be cons tituted in 
regional, zonal and district level as prescribed. 
(3) There shall be an evaluation and monitoring mec hanism in 
every ministry as prescribed to facilitate the cent ral monitoring and 
evaluation committee.  
(4) The secretariat of the monitoring and evaluatio n committee 
shall be located in the office Prime minister and council of minister.', 14, 'Good Governance (Management and Operation) Act, 2064 (2008), Chapter-5, Section 38 (Monitoring and evaluation committee)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
