and supervision of the governmental work shall be as prescribed.', 15, 'Good Governance (Management and Operation) Act, 2064 (2008), Chapter-5, Section 39 (Disposal of Government Function and Supervision of Government)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_good_governance_management_and_operation_act__2064_good_governance_management_and_operation_act_2064_pdf:5.16', 'doc_good_governance_management_and_operation_act__2064_good_governance_management_and_operation_act_2064_pdf', 'doc_good_governance_management_and_operation_act__2064_good_governance_management_and_operation_act_2064_pdf:5', 2, 'section', '40', 'Facilities of service shall be as prescribed :  In addition to the facilities', 'Facilities of service shall be as prescribed', 'received by the chief secretary, secretary, head of  the department or 
