Act shall ipso facto be converted into Land Reform Office and Land
Reform Officers respectively after the commencement of this Act; and the
functions under the Act relating to Land, 2021 (1963) shall be carried out
by the Land Reform Office or Land Reform Officer under that Act, after
the commencement of this Act.
