approval to cultivate the not registered land.
(3) Only those persons who have not any land of their own up to the
prescribed ceiling as tenants or land holders shall be entitled to make
application pursuant to Sub-section (2).
(4) Subject to this Act and the Rules, the prescribed committee
framed under this Act and other prevailing Nepal law may grant approval to
the persons as referred to in Sub-section (3) to cultivate the not registered
land.
(5) In granting approval by the prescribed committee pursuant to
Sub-section (4), the terms for cultivation of such land and the fee therefor
shall be as prescribed.
