vehicle.', 3, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: I (Medium Vehicle)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:1.4', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:1', 2, 'rule', '5', 'Small Vehicle', 'Small Vehicle', 'A vehicle weighing upto 4 ton as indicated by (e) of Definition -2, should be known as smal l vehicle.', 4, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: I (Small Vehicle)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:1.5', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:1', 2, 'rule', '6', 'Public Vehicle', 'Public Vehicle', 'a.) A vehicle that has received the registration certificate for transportation service will be known as a public
vehicle.
b.) The public vehicle will be divided into two types:
i) Passenger’s vehicle ii) Goods vehicle
c.) The passenger’s vehicle will be given the permission to dri ve in following classes only after dividing into
two parts namely day & night: -
c.i) Direct Service
c.ii) Express Service
c.iii) Local Service
d.) The passenger’s vehicle classified by sub article- b should ha ve the state, speed and other necessary
management as indicated.
e.) To make identify the public vehicles, they should have numberpl ate as indicated by definition –2 in both
front & backside.', 5, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: I (Public Vehicle)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:1.6', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:1', 2, 'rule', '7', 'Tourist vehicle', 'Tourist vehicle', 'a. The public vehicle that has got the registration certificat e to serve foreigners will be known tourist
vehicle.
b. To identify the tourist vehicles they should have number plate as indicated by definition–2’s in both front
& backside.', 6, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: I (Tourist vehicle)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:1.7', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:1', 2, 'rule', '8', 'Private Vehicle', 'Private Vehicle', 'a. The vehicle registered for private use will be registered as a private vehicle
b. The private vehicle will not be allowed for public transportation use
c. To make identify the private vehicles, they should have number plate as indicated by statement –2’s v08
u in front & back side.', 7, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: I (Private Vehicle)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:1.8', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:1', 2, 'rule', '9', 'Governmental Vehicle', 'Governmental Vehicle', 'a. The vehicle registered under any organization name
b. To make identify the governmental vehicles ,they should have number pl ate as indicated by statement-2’s
v08 3 in front & back side', 8, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: I (Governmental Vehicle)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:1.9', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:1', 2, 'rule', '10', 'Institutional Vehicle', 'Institutional Vehicle', 'a. The vehicle registered on the name of organization on the full or half proprietorship of HMG.
b. To make identify the institutional vehicles, they should have numbe r plate as indicated by statement-
2’s v08 ª in both front & back side', 9, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: I (Institutional Vehicle)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:1.10', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:1', 2, 'rule', '11', 'Vehicle with Diplomatic Facility', 'Vehicle with Diplomatic Facility', 'a. The vehicle registered under the name of office, plan, organi zation or an individual who has got the
diplomatic facility.
b. To make identify the diplomatic facilitated vehicles, they should have numberplate as indicated by of
Statement –2 of v08 r .', 10, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: I (Vehicle with Diplomatic Facility)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:1.11', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:1', 2, 'rule', '12', 'Used for other purposes', 'Used for other purposes', 'a. The vehicle registered for one purpose shouldn’t be used for other purposes.
b. Such vehicle that has been given custom free for a certain purpos e, except that particular purpose ,it
won’t get custom free service.', 11, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: I (Used for other purposes)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', NULL, 1, 'chapter', 'PART-III', '', NULL, 'RELATING TO VEHICLE REGISTRATION', 2, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '13', 'Necessity to register while importing the vehicle', 'Necessity to register while importing the vehicle', 'a. While importing any vehicle through any place into the country the owne r like an individual, company
etc. must write an application to the police station of the same place.
b. If there comes any application relating to sub article –a, the police office should investigate the evidence
of the payment, & other related papers then it should give the entrance registration certificate to the
importing person, Form, or company for 15 days. This information should be im mediately sent to the
related Transportation Management Office.', 0, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Necessity to register while importing the vehicle)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '14', 'Necessity to register the vehicle', 'Necessity to register the vehicle', 'a. After the vehicle owner has brought the vehicle inside the country paying the custom & the agents who
have fixed the rate , s/he must register in the authorized officers within 15 days.
b. If the owner hasn’t followed sub article –a ,s/he will not be allowed to drive the vehicle.', 1, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Necessity to register the vehicle)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '15', 'Necessity to write an application while registering the vehicle', 'Necessity to write an application while registering the vehicle', 'a. If the owner has to register the vehicle according to Articl e 14, s/he has to indicate the purchaser i.e., an
individual, Form, Company, or agent and the evidence of purchase if the d eal has been done within the
country or if the deal has been done outside the country, the name of the seller i.e., an individual or
company or agent, the evidence of purchase and the proof of payment of tax, & other relating papers in
the prescribed method including the needed charge with the application.
b. The person who is writing the application, according to sub article -a, will have to include his Nepali
Citizenship’s one copy & three recent passport sized photos along with the application.
c. In the case of governmental vehicle, the letter of the office of which name is being written as the owner
& in case of diplomatic facilitated vehicle, the request letter of Ministry of Foreign Affairs, HMG should
be included. To register the diplomatic facilitated vehicle in t he name of a person, a copy of citizenship
or passport with 3 passport sized photos of the person.
d. If any foreigner who is staying in the country doing any business, wants to buy a vehicle for own use and
register it, s/he has to present the documents indicated by A rticle –a & b, including the recommendation
letter of the related Diplomatic Mission. If the vehicle is being registered in the name of a minor, the
guardian of him/ her & a minor have to include three passport-sized photos each and a photocopy of
his/her citizenship in the application.', 2, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Necessity to write an application while registering the vehicle)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.3', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '16', 'Certificate of vehicle registration', 'Certificate of vehicle registration', 'a. If there is any such application on vehicle registration as indica ted by Article 15, the authorized officials
must examine the application & register the vehicle and submit the registration certificate based on
statement 3.
ο But a vehicle with more than 14 seats and weighing more than 4 tons can only be registered as private
vehicle by the organizations legally established with social, religious, educational, charity motives.
b. While registering the vehicle on the name of a minor, name of t he guardian must be written in the
registration certificate with his/her signature.
c. In registration certificate, one should write the total weight of load capacity written in the technical
information given by the vehicle company as the total weight of the vehicle & while writing about the
weight of vehicle, one should separate the weight of vehicle with the whole weight including the total
load capacity.
d. Registration certificate will be valid for one year from the date of registration.', 3, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Certificate of vehicle registration)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.4', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '17', 'Necessity of the certificate for the capacity of driving on the road', 'Necessity of the certificate for the capacity of driving on the road', 'a. As indicated by Article 16, before registering the vehicle, i t should be well checked whether it can be
used or not under the measurements procedure given on Article 23 & if it is okay, registration certificate
should be given. While giving away the certificate, the proof that it can be driven on the road or Road
Ordination Certificate should also be given.
b. According to sub article-a, the certificate of capability of the vehicle should be stuck on it everyday/time.', 4, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Necessity of the certificate for the capacity of driving on the road)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.5', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '18', 'Combined Registration', 'Combined Registration', 'If anybody has to register the vehicle in more than one owner , they have to write an application
according to Article 15 & the authorized officer should examine the vehicle then according to Article 16 the
owners will get their vehicle registered in their name.', 5, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Combined Registration)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.6', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '19', 'Temporary Registration', 'Temporary Registration', 'According to the condition of the owner, the vehicle can be temporarily registe red:
a. If the owner has an excusable reason for not being able to attend on the given date of registration .
b. If the vehicle to be registered has broken down on the way & can’t be brought for registration
immediately.
c. If the owner is having case with the vehicle company or the a gent due to v08 v on insurance & can’t be
registered immediately.', 6, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Temporary Registration)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.7', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '20', 'An application for temporary registration', 'An application for temporary registration', 'a. If the importer is or can’t attend on the registration day beca use of being involved due to Article 19,
his/her heir can register the vehicle on the name of importe r temporarily so he must write an application
including the revenue paid bill, & other necessary documents in indicated way with needed custom to the
rightful & authorized personnel.
b. If the importer’s heir is writing an application then, s/he mus t include a photocopy of his/her citizenship
(Nepali) & moreover three photos of the temporary owner taken recently.', 7, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (An application for temporary registration)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.8', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '21', 'Certificate of temporary Registration', 'Certificate of temporary Registration', 'a. According to Article 20, if there come any such temporary registration cases, the responsible person must
investigate the case if it can be registered according to Article 20 or not & should give the registration
certificate as indicated by Statement 4.
b. To write ‘temporary’ in the numberplate should be informed in the temporary registered certificate.
c. Temporary registered certificate can be hired for six months maximum whether at once or again & again.
ο Corrected in 1 st Amendment.', 8, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Certificate of temporary Registration)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.9', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '22', 'Necessity of bringing the vehicle', 'Necessity of bringing the vehicle', 'To register the vehicle according to Article 13,15 & 20,to pass or change the name according to
Article 37 & to change the things of vehicle according to Arti cle 39 , while doing any such things & writing
an application, one should take the vehicle with him/her/', 9, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Necessity of bringing the vehicle)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.10', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '23', 'Limitation on measurement of vehicle’s investigation', 'Limitation on measurement of vehicle’s investigation', 'a. HMG can determine the necessary limitation of measuring the vehicle is in driving condition or not:
a.I Relating to the vehicle’s mechanical condition.
a.II Relating to the length, breadth, height, figure of vehicle.
a.III Relating to the possible pollution by vehicle.
a.IV Relating to the possibility of duration of vehicle.
b. While examining the possibility of using the vehicle & giving the capability certificate or , the authorized
personnel must perform his/her duty staying under sub article-a.', 10, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Limitation on measurement of vehicle’s investigation)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.11', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '24', 'Possibility of rejection of the vehicle registration', 'Possibility of rejection of the vehicle registration', 'a. If the authorized personnel examines the vehicle according to Ar ticle 23 due to the application for
registration & the vehicle isn’t in good condition, such vehicle can be rejected to register.
b. If the vehicle has been rejected to be registered according to s ub article –a , the officers must inform the
applicant with the reason.
c. No matter what ever is written in sub article –a & b, if the Department feels that any vehicle should be
stopped to be registered as mentioned in Article 14 due to environment al pollution, density of vehicle,
state of the road, difficulty in coming & going of vehicle or any other reason seeking the welfare of the
general people, it may give the order to stop the registration of any vehicle in some or all the
Transportation Management Offices.', 11, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Possibility of rejection of the vehicle registration)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.12', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '25', 'Approval of registering application', 'Approval of registering application', 'a. According to this Act, a vehicle registered in one part of the vehicle can be used in other part.
b. No matter what is written in sub article-a, the vehicle reg istered in on part can’t be used in other part
more then one year.
But these rules will not be effective to the institutional &diplomatic facilitated governmental vehicles
& who have road permit.', 12, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Approval of registering application)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.13', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '26', 'Necessity to inform', 'Necessity to inform', 'a. The vehicle, which is being registered in one part, must inform the police while entering the other part
within 24 hours.
b. If the vehicle has to stay in that area for more than 30 days, s /he has to get the permission of the officer
within 7 days.', 13, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Necessity to inform)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.14', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '27', 'Migration Registration', 'Migration Registration', 'a. If the vehicle has to stay in other part more than the time g iven by sub article-b, of Article 25 , the vehicle
owner has to write an application to the authorized personnel including the registration certificate along
with 3 passport sized photos recently taken with needed custom for migration certificate.
b. The authorized personnel must examine the condition on the applicati on in sub article-a , if the vehicle is
in well condition according to Article 23, they must give migration registration certificate to the owner.', 14, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Migration Registration)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.15', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '28', 'Estimation of the vehicle', 'Estimation of the vehicle', 'While registering the vehicle according to this Act, the aut horized officer should include the vehicle
owner’s name, address, date of vehicle registration, registr ation number, vehicle’s company’s name, model,
year, engine No., Chesis No., type of vehicle, & weight of it, etc. in the Registration Book &put the maximum
estimate of the vehicle. In such registration paper of that book, t he vehicle owner should also stick his/her
photo in it.', 15, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Estimation of the vehicle)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.16', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '29', 'No foreign vehicle without permission', 'No foreign vehicle without permission', 'The vehicle registered in foreign country must not be driven inside the kingdom of Nepal without
legal permission.', 16, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (No foreign vehicle without permission)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.17', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '30', 'Permission to drive foreign vehicle', 'Permission to drive foreign vehicle', 'The vehicle registered in foreign country can be driven inside th e Kingdom of the owner applies to
the authorized officer with necessary custom for maximum one month.
But such vehicle shall not be permitted for transport service in the King dom.', 17, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Permission to drive foreign vehicle)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.18', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '31', 'Registration Certificate renewal', 'Registration Certificate renewal', 'a. Within the three months of last valid date in registration for m in according to sub article-d ,of Article 16,
one should have renewed the registration certificate.
b. To renew the registration certificate, according to sub artic le – a , the vehicle owner or the heir must put
in front the needed custom to the authorized officer. But vehicle with the
diplomatic facility won’t have to pay any custom during renewing of registration certificate.
c. If there come such registration certificate, as indicated by sub article-b, for renewal, the officer must
renew it for next one year.
d. To renew the registration form according to sub article – a, which is outdated , the vehicle owner has to
pay the custom & extra charge to time crossed like 100% if 1 y ear, 200% if 2 years, 300% if 3 years,
400% if 4 years,500% if 5 years etc.', 18, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Registration Certificate renewal)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.19', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '32', 'Authorized officer can inform', 'Authorized officer can inform', 'If any vehicle with diplomatic facility has not been brought f or renewal of the registration certificate
in time according to sub article –a ,of Article 31, then the authori zed officer may give notice to renew to the
related lgof]u ,organization ,office or an individual through Ministry of Foreign Affairs .', 19, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Authorized officer can inform)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.20', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '33', 'Special regulation relating to renewal', 'Special regulation relating to renewal', 'No matter what is written in sub article – c of Article 31, if the governmental, institutional, private &
diplomatic facilitated vehicles’ owners want to renew the r egistration certificate for 5 years at once, the
authorized officer can renew it for 5 years at once with the needed custom for 5 years.', 20, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Special regulation relating to renewal)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.21', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '34', 'Self-dissolving of registration certificate', 'Self-dissolving of registration certificate', 'a. The registration certificate not renewed in the given date as indicated by sub article- d of Article 31, will
be self-dissolved.
b. The estimation of such vehicle whose registration form has been dissolved as mentioned in sub article – a
,will be excluded .
c. The registration form whose estimation has been cut as mentioned in sub article – b, will not be renewed.', 21, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Self-dissolving of registration certificate)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.22', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '35', 'Possibility of registration again', 'Possibility of registration again', 'If the rejected registered form as mentioned in Article 34, i s brought to be renewed, it will not be
renewed but a new certificate on the basis of Article 16,will be given but only after taking custom charge
remained according to Article 31 ,& extra custom charge & more over twice the extra charge as a fine of the
years after which it has been brought to be renewed as accorded by sub article – d of Article 31.', 22, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Possibility of registration again)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.23', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '36', 'Necessity of informing if the address of vehicle owner has been changed', 'Necessity of informing if the address of vehicle owner has been changed', 'a. According to this Act, if any vehicle owner has changed the address , s/he must inform the authorized
officer about this including the registration certificate within on month.
b. After receiving the information as indicated by sub article – a , the authorized officer must correct the
address in registration certificate & Registration Book as well.', 23, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Necessity of informing if the address of vehicle owner has been changed)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.24', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '37', 'To transfer the name', 'To transfer the name', 'a. According to this Act, if the vehicle owner transfers the vehic le owner’s name by selling, giving, or any
other way, s/he has to submit an application within 15 days of trans ferring the name, to the authorized
officer including registration certificate & tax paid bill.
b. If the vehicle owner dies, the rightful heir must write an appli cation to the authorized personnel to
transfer name including the death certificate, registration c ertificate ,tax paid bill, & the evidence to
prove him/herself as the rightful heir of the vehicle within 35 days of the death of the vehicle owner.
c. If there come any such cases relating to sub article – a & b, the authorized officer must do investigation
& give the name transfer certificate informing as name tra nsferred in registration certificate taking the
custom charge. But, if in case , there arouse more than one
rightful owner ,then the name of all the rightful owners should be transferred instead of the dead owner’s
name and in such case name are combinely registered.
d. According to sub article- c , if the name has been transferred , then it should be well informed in
registration book.
e. According to this Article, if the authorized personnel finds out any c ases or problems on rightful owner
or not in context of transferring the name, the name will not be transferred until the problems are solved.', 24, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (To transfer the name)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.25', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '38', 'Unchangeable Register', 'Unchangeable Register', 'No matter what has been written in this Act, the vehicle regis tered as load vehicle cannot be changed
into transportation service registered vehicle.', 25, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Unchangeable Register)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.26', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '39', 'Not changeable without permission', 'Not changeable without permission', 'a. Without the permission of the authorized officers, the vehicle owne r mustn’t change color, ο number of
seats, shape, engine or chesis of the vehicle. But this sub articl e won’t take changing simple parts of the
vehicle ,as a big problem.
b. According to sub article – a , if the owner requests for the permi ssion of changing anything in the
vehicle authorized personnel will permit it only after doing necessary investigation.
ωBut changing the specification of vehicle given by the Vehicle Company can’t be permitted.
ω b.i) While giving permission of making changes as mentioned by sub ar ticle –b, 50% of the charge for
vehicle registration should be taken.', 26, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Not changeable without permission)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.27', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '40', 'Possibility of registration certificate to be postponed', 'Possibility of registration certificate to be postponed', 'a. The authorized officer may postponed the registration certificat e for following reason for the following
period of time :
a.I If the vehicle has damaged on any property or somebody due to it’s ba d condition & it has not
been repaired satisfactorily, until that time , &
ο Corrected in 1 st amendment.
ω Added in 1 st amendment.
a.II Can be postponed for maximum 6 months, if the vehicle owner has disobeyed a ny condition and
the rules of this Act and also driven the vehicle without obeyi ng the orders of the authorized
personnel.
b. While ordering the vehicle owner about the postponed as indicated by sub article – a , the authorized
personnel must show the reason.
c. If the registration certificate has been postponed , the authorized personnel must inform the related police
office.
d. If the registration certificate has been postponed according to sub article – a, within 7 days of such order,
the vehicle owner must submit the registration certificate to the authorized personnel.
e. After the postponed date has finished, the authorized personnel must retur n the registration certificate to
the owner got through sub article d.
f. After returning the registration certificate to the owner ac cording to sub article –e, the authorized
personnel must write the postponed period & the reason behind it on the registration certificate and
inscription registration book as well.', 27, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Possibility of registration certificate to be postponed)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.28', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '41', 'Expulsion of registration certificate', 'Expulsion of registration certificate', 'a. According to this Act, If any vehicle becomes unable to be driven or is being taken out of the country
forever, the vehicle owner should submit an application to the authoriz ed personnel for deducting the
estimation along with the registration certificate within 30 days.
But if the parts of the vehicle which have importance, is ne eded to be taken out of the country the
vehicle owner has to get the permission from the authorized personnel.
b. If there comes any application relating to sub article –a, authoriz ed personnel should investigate the
information of the application. If everything seems all right , authorized personnel should reject the
registration certificate write in the registration Book deducting the estimation.', 28, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Expulsion of registration certificate)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.29', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '42', 'Deduction in renewal custom', 'Deduction in renewal custom', 'According to this Act, if the registered vehicle hasn’t been abl e to be driven due to its bad condition ,
accident or confiscation for more than one year , the owner can inf orm to the authorized personnel with
registration certificate along with evidence, then the offic er can deduct ο the custom on renew for that
period.', 29, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Deduction in renewal custom)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.30', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '43', 'Necessity to give a transcript of Registration certificate', 'Necessity to give a transcript of Registration certificate', 'a. If the registration certificate is lost, tore, or has become so old that words can be hardly read then within
15 days, the owner must write an application to the authorized personnel along with necessary custom.
b. If the authorized personnel finds correct the information in the appl ication after the investigation on the
case or application relating to sub article – a, s/he should give s uch owner a new transcript of the
registration certificate.
c. The information of such transcript arrival as mentioned by sub art icle- b, will be given to the concerned
police office.', 30, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Necessity to give a transcript of Registration certificate)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2.31', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:2', 2, 'rule', '44', 'Specification to be submitted', 'Specification to be submitted', 'a. The Form, Company or agent who import the vehicles should give the infor mation about every vehicle
like the model of the vehicle, Engine number, chesis number, including type of the vehicle, the name of
the manufacturer, the name of the customer & time of purchase of the vehicle, & the number of the
remaining vehicles which have already been in stock, to the authorized personnel every month.
οCorrected in 1 st amendment.
b. Except the documents as indicated by sub article – a, the authoriz ed personnel may even ask for other
information & papers about the imported vehicle to the distributors li ke Forms, Company or agent &
such Form, Company or an agent must obey the duty to present such documents & files immediately.', 31, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART-III (Specification to be submitted)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', NULL, 1, 'chapter', 'PART:IV', '', NULL, 'RELATING TO DRIVING LICENSE', 3, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:IV', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3', 2, 'rule', '45', 'Mustn’t drive', 'Mustn’t drive', 'No one can drive any vehicle without having driving license.', 0, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:IV (Mustn’t drive)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3', 2, 'rule', '46', 'Mustn’t let one drive', 'Mustn’t let one drive', 'No vehicle owner can let one drive who has not received the driving license.', 1, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:IV (Mustn’t let one drive)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3.2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3', 2, 'rule', '47', 'Unfit for driving', 'Unfit for driving', 'Following people will be taken as unfit for being a driver :
a. People less than 21 years age for large vehicle.
b. People below 18 years age for driving medium & small vehicles. But for motorcycle or other such 2-
wheel vehicle, a person over 16 years can get the driving license.
c. A person suffering from Epilepsy, or madness or dizziness or other such diseases of being unconscious.
d. A person who has very poor eyesight even after using spectacles.
e. A person who can’t hear even simple sound or horn etc.
f. A person who can’t recognize the colors like red, yellow, green e tc. immediately or having vision
problem.
g. A person suffering from Nightblindness. Or
h. A person who has weak or useless limbs.
But this rule will not be effective for vehicle made especially for disabled people.', 2, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:IV (Unfit for driving)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3.3', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3', 2, 'rule', '48', 'An application for driving license', 'An application for driving license', 'a. A person not having any disabled or unfit characters as indicated by Article 47, may apply for driving
license if s/he wants with an application in prescribed way to the authorized personnel.
b. An applicant applying for driving license must include prescribed c ustom, transcript of citizenship,
recently taken 3 passport sized photos, Health Certificate given b y the HMG approved physician after
doing checkups & the transcript given by the Training Center about the type of vehicle s/he is interested
to drive.
49.
Examination of the Applicant:
a. After the application is received related to Article 48, thew ability of the applicant should be examined
whether s/he can drive the mentioned vehicle ,has the knowledge a bout vehicle Act , rules & signs of
traffic or not .For such examination, subject & procedure will be directed by the Department.
b. The failure among the application in the examination as indica ted by sub article-a, will not be allowed to
re-apply within 3 months of the last given examination date.', 3, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:IV (An application for driving license)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3.4', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3', 2, 'rule', '50', 'Driving License will be given', 'Driving License will be given', 'a. According to Article 49, ∃ …the successful applicant will be given the driving license, by
authorized personnel in the recommendation of the Samiti in accordance of Statement - 5.
∃ Cut in 1 st amendment.
b. While giving away the driving license the type of vehicle, la rge, medium or small or all allowed to drive
should be clearly written in the license.
c. No matter what has been written in this Act elsewhere , the public transport driver will have prescribed
method to receive the driving license.', 4, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:IV (Driving License will be given)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3.5', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3', 2, 'rule', '51', 'Will be in examination', 'Will be in examination', 'a. The driving license given as indicated by Article 50, will be only for one year as an examination period.
b. If the driver doesn’t cross the rules & regulations of this Act over 5 times, in his own request, the
authorized personnel will transfer the driving license into permanent one.', 5, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:IV (Will be in examination)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3.6', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3', 2, 'rule', '52', 'Approval of Driving License got from foreign country', 'Approval of Driving License got from foreign country', 'The authorized personnel can give license for such applicant who has already got Driving License
from foreign country if s/he applies in accordance of Article 48 with prescribed custom.
But such person won’t have to give examination to get driving license.', 6, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:IV (Approval of Driving License got from foreign country)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3.7', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3', 2, 'rule', '53', 'Approval of International Driving License', 'Approval of International Driving License', 'The person having International Driving License, can drive the prescribed vehicle throughout the
kingdom – Nepal.
54.
a. The person receiving Driving License on the basis of Articl e 50 ,can drive only such vehicles written in
the license.
b. The driver can be able to drive such vehicles inside the country staying under control of sub article – a.
c. The driving license will be appointed or valid for 5 years from the date of giving the Driving license.', 7, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:IV (Approval of International Driving License)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3.8', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3', 2, 'rule', '55', 'Including other vehicles in the Driving License', 'Including other vehicles in the Driving License', 'a. If any driver wants to include any other vehicle in Driving Lice nse, s/he should write an application to
the authorized personnel including the type of vehicle to be added & the needed custom.
b. If there come any application relating to sub article – a, to be sure that the applicant is capable of driving
it, the Examination Committee has to test the driver.
c. If the applicant passes the examination as indicated by sub art icle-b, the authorized personnel must add
the wanted vehicle in the license & give new Driving License.
d. ο While giving the new Driving License according to sub article – c , the license will be for examination
period as indicated by Article 51.', 8, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:IV (Including other vehicles in the Driving License)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3.9', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3', 2, 'rule', '56', 'Driving license renewal', 'Driving license renewal', 'a. After three months of the date of invalid of license, written a ccording to sub article – c of Article 54, the
driver should have renewed the driving license.
b. Within the date as indicated by sub article – a the driver shoul d write an application for ωDriving license
Renewal along with needed custom to the authorized personnel.
c. If there comes the Driving License Renewal application accor ding to sub article – b, the authorized
personnel should renew it for next five-year.
d. To renew the driving license according sub article – a, which has already become invalid, the authorized
personnel should take the needed custom moreover revenue for being dela yed, 100% for one year, 200%
for 2 years, 300% for 3 years, 400% for 4 years & 500% for 5 years % renew the license.
ο Corrected in 1 st amendment.
ω Added in 1 st amendment.', 9, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:IV (Driving license renewal)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3.10', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3', 2, 'rule', '57', 'Self Dissolving of Driving License', 'Self Dissolving of Driving License', 'a. If the license is not brought for renewing within the given time as indicated by sub article – d , of Article
56, the license will dissolve.
b. The estimation will be cut after the driving license is dissolved as mentioned in sub article – a.
c. The driving license of which estimation has been cut as mentioned in sub article – b will not be renewed.', 10, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:IV (Self Dissolving of Driving License)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3.11', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3', 2, 'rule', '58', 'Necessity of Health certificate to renew', 'Necessity of Health certificate to renew', 'While applying for Renewal of Driving license, the health cer tificate given by approved physician
should be included.', 11, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:IV (Necessity of Health certificate to renew)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3.12', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3', 2, 'rule', '59', 'Necessity to inform if the driver has changed permanent address', 'Necessity to inform if the driver has changed permanent address', 'a. If the driver has changed address, s/he should inform the authorized personnel within one month of
migration.
b. After the officer gets information about the migration ,s/he has to write the present permanent address
even in Registration Book.', 12, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:IV (Necessity to inform if the driver has changed permanent address)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3.13', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3', 2, 'rule', '60', 'Driving License can be suspended', 'Driving License can be suspended', 'If the driver breaks the rules & regulations of this Act for more than five ti mes & if this is proved, the
officer can suspend the driver license for maximum 6 months.', 13, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:IV (Driving License can be suspended)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3.14', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3', 2, 'rule', '61', 'Rejection of Driving License', 'Rejection of Driving License', 'a. If there found any disabled characters according to Article 47 , in the driver ,the authorized personnel
can reject he driving license & can order the driver to give back the license.
b. If the driver gets an order to give back the driving license according to sub article – a, within 7 days, s/he
must give it back to the authorized personnel.', 14, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:IV (Rejection of Driving License)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3.15', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:3', 2, 'rule', '62', 'Transcript of driving license', 'Transcript of driving license', 'a. If the license is lost , tore or the words can hardly be read or somehow damaged , the driver must write
an application to the authorized personnel for transcript of the lic ense within 7 days including ω
prescribed custom .
b. If everything is proved after investigation upon the application as indicated by sub article – a , the officer
will give the transcript of driving license
c. The authorized personnel as indicated by sub article-b, will inform the arrival of transcript of driving
license to the related police station.', 15, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:IV (Transcript of driving license)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', NULL, 1, 'chapter', 'PART:V', '', NULL, 'RELATING TO CONDUCTOR LICENSE', 4, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:V', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4', 2, 'rule', '63', 'No conductor without having conductor license', 'No conductor without having conductor license', 'No one can be a conductor without having conductor license in the public transport vehicles.', 0, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:V (No conductor without having conductor license)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4', 2, 'rule', '64', 'Cannot let one do the conductor job', 'Cannot let one do the conductor job', 'ω Added in 1 st amendment.
No vehicle owner or manager can let one do the conductor’s job without receiving conductor’s
license.', 1, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:V (Cannot let one do the conductor job)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4.2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4', 2, 'rule', '65', 'Unfit for being a conductor', 'Unfit for being a conductor', 'One can be unfit to get conductor license :
a. under 18 years old.
b. Can’t read or write.
c. Can’t present the certificate of being healthy.', 2, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:V (Unfit for being a conductor)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4.3', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4', 2, 'rule', '66', 'Application for conductor’s license', 'Application for conductor’s license', ':
a. Any person without having any unfitness characters according to A rticle 65, can apply for conductor
license with needed method.
b. An application applying for conductor license must include prescr ibed custom, transcript of citizenship
, recently taken 3 passport sized photos and health certificate gi ven by the physician approved by HMG
after doing check up .', 3, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:V (Application for conductor’s license)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4.4', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4', 2, 'rule', '67', 'Conductor license to be given', 'Conductor license to be given', 'a. After the authorized personnel receive the application, s/he has to i nvestigate and as indicated by
statement 6, s/he should give conductor license. after receiving conductor license , s/he must regulate the
public transport perfectly.
b. Conductor license will be valid for next 5 years from the license-received date.', 4, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:V (Conductor license to be given)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z')
;

INSERT INTO document_nodes (id, document_id, parent_id, depth, node_type, identifier, title, heading, content, position, citation, created_at) VALUES
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4.5', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4', 2, 'rule', '68', 'Conductor license Renewal', 'Conductor license Renewal', 'a. Within the three month of the invalid date written in the conductor l icense in according to sub article-b
of article 67 it must be renewed.
b. While renewing the conductor license within the given date as indi cated by sub article –b s/he must
include the prescribed custom to the authorized personnel.
c. If there comes any such application relating to sub article –b the authorized personnel must renew it for
next 5 years.
d. To renew the invalid driving license as indicated by sub artic le –a the authorized personnel should
charge more tax except the regular custom charge , like 100% for one year .200 % for 2 year, 300% for
3 years, 400% for 4 year, 500% for 5 year.', 5, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:V (Conductor license Renewal)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4.6', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4', 2, 'rule', '69', 'Self-Dissolving of Conductor license', 'Self-Dissolving of Conductor license', 'a. If any conductor hasn’t renewed the license within the given date as indicated by sub article-d of article
68 his license will dissolved.
b. The Conductor’s license which has been dissolved as mentioned in sub arti cle –a, the estimation of such
will also dissolve.
c. The conductor’s license whose estimation has also been dissolved as mentioned in sub article –b, will
not be renewed.', 6, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:V (Self-Dissolving of Conductor license)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4.7', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4', 2, 'rule', '70', 'Necessity to inform if his address is changed', 'Necessity to inform if his address is changed', 'a. If any conductor is migrating or has migrated, s/he must inform the authorized personnel about this.
b. After receiving the application, the authorized personnel must write the new address over the registration
book as well.', 7, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:V (Necessity to inform if his address is changed)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4.8', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4', 2, 'rule', '71', 'Conductor license can be suspended', 'Conductor license can be suspended', 'If any conductor is found breaking this Act or any rules under this A ct, more than 5 times, then the
concerned officer can suspend the license for maximum six months.', 8, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:V (Conductor license can be suspended)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4.9', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4', 2, 'rule', '72', 'Rejection of Conductor license', 'Rejection of Conductor license', 'a. if the conductor is found having any disability as indicated by Art icle 65, then the concerned officer can
order to give back the license from the conductor & reject it.
b. After receiving the order as indicated by sub article- a , the conductor has to return the license within the
7 days of order.', 9, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:V (Rejection of Conductor license)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4.10', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:4', 2, 'rule', '73', 'Transcript of conductor license to be given', 'Transcript of conductor license to be given', 'a. If the license is lost or somehow damaged, the conductor has to wr ite as application to the concerned
officer indicating the transcript to be given ω including the needed custom charge within 7 days.
b. If all the information written in the application relating to s ub article – a , are found correct ,the
concerned officer will give the applicant the transcript of conductor license.
c. The arrival of such transcript as indicated by sub article – b, will be informed to the concerned police
station by the concerned office.', 10, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:V (Transcript of conductor license to be given)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', NULL, 1, 'chapter', 'PART:VI', '', NULL, 'TRANSPORTATION MANAGEMENT', 5, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '74', 'Decision of route', 'Decision of route', 'After estimating the route in the proper place for public transpor t, the Department has to publish it
for informing general people.', 0, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Decision of route)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '75', 'Prohibition for driving without road permit', 'Prohibition for driving without road permit', 'Even after deciding the route according to Article 74, public tra nsportation can’t be without road
permit.', 1, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Prohibition for driving without road permit)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '76', 'An Application for road permit', 'An Application for road permit', 'To apply for road permit, the manager or the vehicle owner should include the prescribed custom
duty to an authorized personnel.', 2, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (An Application for road permit)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.3', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '77', 'Road Permit to be given', 'Road Permit to be given', 'a. If there comes any application relating to Article 76, the conc erned officer has to give the road permit
certificate on the road permit certificate on the basis of statement 7 under article 78.', 3, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Road Permit to be given)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.4', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '78', 'Necessary investigations to be done while giving road permit', 'Necessary investigations to be done while giving road permit', 'While giving away the road permit certificate any public tra nsportation according to article 77, the
concerned officer has to examine if ο the public vehicle’s owner or the manager, has completed the giv en
criteria:-
a. Insurance of the driver, conductor, security people & other workers in the vehicle even the third party.
b. fitness of a vehicle.
c. Renewed registration certificate.', 4, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Necessary investigations to be done while giving road permit)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.5', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '79', 'If necessity to change the route /road', 'If necessity to change the route /road', 'a. If anyone has to change the route of the public transportation withi n the valid date, the vehicle owner of
the manager has to apply for the road/route permit according to article 76 & get it.
ω Added in 1 st amendment.
ο Corrected in 1 st amendment.
b. If there comes any application related to sub article – a, the authorized officer has to suspend the
previously given route firstly and then give the new route permit.', 5, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (If necessity to change the route /road)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.6', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '80', 'Multi route permit can be given', 'Multi route permit can be given', 'a. No matter what is written in this Act elsewhere, the authoriz ed officer can give multi route permit to any
public vehicle if there are other route .
b. While applying for multi permit as indicated by sub article – a, the vehicle owner or the manager has to
include the prescribed custom charge for every route.', 6, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Multi route permit can be given)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.7', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '81', 'k6s] Route permit', 'k6s] Route permit', 'a. If any public vehicle has to use any other route for certain purpos e, the vehicle owner or the manager has
to write an application indicating to the authorized officer in pr escribed procedure along with prescribed
custom duties to get k6s] route permit certificate.
b. If there come any such application as indicated by sub article – a, the authorized personnel should give
one time route permit certificate for 7 days only.', 7, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (k6s] Route permit)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.8', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '82', 'Rejection of Route Permit', 'Rejection of Route Permit', 'a. No matter what ever is written in other part of this Act , while giving the route permit of any route, they
have to examine the passenger capacity of that road & number of vehicles already having route permit
for that route. If it seems no necessary to ad up the vehicles or there is pollution problem of any other
problems/ causes that will effect the general’s goodwill, the n the authorized personnel ω can consult the
management committee & reject to give route permit.
b. The vehicles running in the medium & long route has to be in prescribed stage for the security of vehicle,
passengers & other workers, If the vehicle is not in prescribed s tage then the authorized personnel can
reject to give the route permit', 8, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Rejection of Route Permit)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.9', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '83', 'Route Permit Renewal', 'Route Permit Renewal', 'a. After the 15 days of the valid date written in the route permit certificate in accordance of sub article – b,
of Article 77, the route permit should have to be renewed.
b. The renew the route permit according to sub article - a, the vehicle owner , manager or any other ordered
person has to include prescribed custom duty while writing the application.
c. For such application relating to sub article – b, the authorized personnel has to renew the route permit for
next four months.
d. To renew the invalid route permit which has already crossed t he given date, the authorized personnel has
to take cent percent custom duty along the custom charge from the vehicle owner or, manager.', 9, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Route Permit Renewal)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.10', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '84', 'Self-Dissolving of route permit', 'Self-Dissolving of route permit', 'a. If the route permit certificate is not brought to renew withi n the given date according to sub article – d
of Article 83, it will dissolve.
b. Along with the dissolving of route permit according to sub article - a, the cost price of route permit will
also dissolve.
c. The route permit certificate of which, cost price has already dissolved according to sub article – b, shall
not be renewed.', 10, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Self-Dissolving of route permit)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.11', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '85', 'Route permit certificate to be given', 'Route permit certificate to be given', 'ω Added in 1 st amendment.
If any vehicle owner of manager of whose the route permit & it s cost price has been dissolved
according to article – 84, comes to get the route permit again, authorized personnel has to take the prescribed
custom charge & other needed extra charge & Rs. 2000/- fine as indi cated by Article 83 from the vehicle
owner or manager & give another route permit certificate according to Article 77.', 11, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Route permit certificate to be given)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.12', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '86', 'Route permit to be given', 'Route permit to be given', 'a. If any vehicle having route permit meets with an accident or due to some reason it gets ruined & if not in
driving condition for more than 4 months, the vehicle owner has to writ e an application exposing all
stuffs & request to postponed the route permit including the route perm it certificate to authorized
personnel .
b. If there comes such application relating to sub article – a, authori zed personnel has to investigate & if all
the information are found correct ,then s/he can postponed route permit till it is repaired.
b.i) HMG can postponed such vehicle’s route permit
for one month which has been driven not in route permit road
c. For the postponed period of route permit of any vehicle the renewal custom charge will be deducted.', 12, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Route permit to be given)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.13', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '87', 'Route permit can be rejected', 'Route permit can be rejected', 'According to this Act, if any vehicle having route permit is no t in reusing condition anymore, the
vehicle owner or the manager of such vehicle has to write an application including the evidences to make the
route permit rejected to authorized personnel.', 13, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Route permit can be rejected)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.14', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '88', 'Transcripts of route permit to be given', 'Transcripts of route permit to be given', 'a. If the route permit license is lost, tore or somehow damaged, the vehicle owner or the manager has to
write an application to authorized personnel indicating the reason i ncluding the custom charge within 7
days.
b. If all the information written in the application relating to s ub article – a, are found correct, then
authorized personnel will give the applicant the transcript of route permit.
c. The arrival of such transcript relating to article – b, will be informed to the concerned police station by
authorized personnel.', 14, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Transcripts of route permit to be given)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.15', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '89', 'Necessity to do fitness test', 'Necessity to do fitness test', 'a. To get route permit license by any public transportation vehicle, fitness test should be done according
to this Act.
b. According to sub article – a, without doing fitness test , route permit license will not be given .', 15, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Necessity to do fitness test)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.16', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '90', 'An application to do fitness test', 'An application to do fitness test', 'If anyone wanting to do fitness test should write an application to the authorized personnel including
the custom charge.', 16, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (An application to do fitness test)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.17', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '91', 'Certificate of fitness test', 'Certificate of fitness test', 'should be given :
a. If there comes any application relating to Article 90, the authoriz ed personnel has to give the certificate
fitness test only after examining the mechanical position & formation of the vehicle.
b. The certificate given in the approval of sub article – a, will be valid for 6 months only.', 17, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Certificate of fitness test)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.18', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '92', 'Re- fitness test to be done', 'Re- fitness test to be done', 'a. Within the 7 days of valid date of fitness test ,written in acc ordance of sub article –b, of article 91, an
application for re- fitness test, should be written ,& re- fitness test should be done
b. If the vehicle’s re- fitness test is not done in the given date in accordance to sub ar ticle –a, & brought
after the last date but within 35 days, fitness test should be done , taking the needed custom charge &
also cent percent extra charge.
c. If the re- fitness test of any vehicle is not done in given time as indicat ed by sub article – b, the
certificate of such fitness test will dissolve In this way, dissolved fitness test of any vehicle to re-
fitness test, the applicant has to pay the prescribed custom cha rge as indicated by sub article-b,& extra
fine upto Rs.5000/- then only, s/he will be given the certificate of fitness test.', 18, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Re- fitness test to be done)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.19', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '93', 'To register the transportation service', 'To register the transportation service', 'a. No vehicle owner or the manager can start transportation serv ice without registering the name of
transportation service in the Department.
b. Any vehicle owner or the manager wanting to register the n ame of the transportation service must
include the custom charge with the application in prescribed way.
c. If the authorized officer finds every information accurate in th e application relating to sub article –b, &
appropriate to register then according to statement 8, Department will allow that vehicle to run under the
registered name handling the license of permission. In this way, a ny transportation service having the
license to start the transportation service if wants to close the service, has to take permission previously
from the department.
d. The license received according to sub article –c, will be vali d for next 5 years, from the date written on
the license.
e. According to this Act, the promotion of personnel working in the transporta tion service office, terms of
service & facility will be according to the prescribed way.', 19, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (To register the transportation service)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.20', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '94', 'Transportation service License Renewal', 'Transportation service License Renewal', 'a. Within 3 months of the given date according to sub article –d of Artic le 93, the transportation service
License should be renewed.
b. To renew the license as indicated by sub article –a, the vehi cle owner, manager nor the deputed person
has to write an application including the custom charge to the Department.
c. If there come any application relating to sub article –b, the D epartment has to renew it for next five
years.
d. The license with invalid date can be renewed only within one month . To renew such license, the regular
custom charge and 100% extra charge will be taken from its vehicle owner or the manager.', 20, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Transportation service License Renewal)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.21', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '95', 'The license for the permission of transportation service can be self dissolved', 'The license for the permission of transportation service can be self dissolved', 'a. If the license is not renewed within the given date as indica ted by sub article –d, of article 94, the license
will dissolve.
b. Along with the dissolving of the license according to sub article –a , the cost price of the license will also
dissolve.
c. The permission license of which, cost price has already dissolved according to sub article –b, shall not be
renewed.', 21, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (The license for the permission of transportation service can be self dissolved)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.22', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '96', 'Determination of fare', 'Determination of fare', 'a. The fare of passenger & goods will be according to the prescribed way.
b. The maximum weight of luggage for free & maximum luggage weight for fare will also be in determined
way.
c. No extra charge can be taken in fare than the fare determined by this Article.', 22, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Determination of fare)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.23', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '97', 'A person not showing the ID card can’t sell the ticket', 'A person not showing the ID card can’t sell the ticket', 'A person who doesn’t show the ID card of himself proving himself to be the personnel of the
transportation service can’t sell the ticket.', 23, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (A person not showing the ID card can’t sell the ticket)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.24', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '98', 'Specimen of passenger’s ticket', 'Specimen of passenger’s ticket', 'a. The specimen of ticket of public vehicles will be in determined way.
b. The person selling the ticket according to sub article-a, must s tamp the name of relating transportation
service on it.', 24, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Specimen of passenger’s ticket)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.25', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '99', 'While carrying goods, bill should be with proper carriage information', 'While carrying goods, bill should be with proper carriage information', 'While carrying goods in public goods carrying vehicle, the conductor has to give a bill to the goods
owner-describing type of goods.', 25, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (While carrying goods, bill should be with proper carriage information)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.26', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '100', 'Necessity to prepare the name list of passenger', 'Necessity to prepare the name list of passenger', 'As indicated by the Department, the vehicle manager of the transportation service of the vehicle
running in long & medium route has to prepare the name list of the passengers travelling on it ,driver,
conductor, safe guards & other people working in the vehicle including the ir age, & address. The
transportation service people who have prepared the list have to ke ep one copy for themselves & should
submit another copy to the authorized personnel or his/her deputy personnel before starting the journey.', 26, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Necessity to prepare the name list of passenger)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.27', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '101', 'Necessity to take the carriage & passengers to the destination safely', 'Necessity to take the carriage & passengers to the destination safely', 'a. After taking the responsibility of passengers or carriage, the owner or the manager of public
transportation service has to take incharge of everything from t he start to the end of the journey. It’ll be
their duty. But, time of reaching the destination
should not be fixed effecting the passengers.
b. If the vehicle breaks down or can’t be driven on the way, it is foremost duty of the take security of
passengers & carriages.
c. If the vehicle becomes unable to be driven as indicated by s ub article –b, the owner or manager has to
manage another vehicle for the passengers.', 27, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Necessity to take the carriage & passengers to the destination safely)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.28', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '102', 'No more passengers than the number of seat', 'No more passengers than the number of seat', 'No public vehicle can put passengers in the vehicle more than th e number of seat written in the
registration certificate.', 28, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (No more passengers than the number of seat)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.29', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '103', 'Necessity to rest', 'Necessity to rest', 'The vehicles running in long distances have to rest for half an hour in every four hours.', 29, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Necessity to rest)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.30', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '104', 'Necessity to change the turn of a driver', 'Necessity to change the turn of a driver', 'The duty of the vehicle owner or the manager of long distance travelling vehicles will be to keep two
drivers & ο in every 6 hours, they’ll have to change their turn.', 30, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Necessity to change the turn of a driver)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.31', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '105', 'Travelling without ticket is prohibited', 'Travelling without ticket is prohibited', 'No passenger can travel without the ticket of the needed fare to the destina tion.', 31, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Travelling without ticket is prohibited)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.32', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '106', 'Necessity to inform about the route map & time of departure & arrival', 'Necessity to inform about the route map & time of departure & arrival', 'a. In every bus stop, an authorized personnel should make other people stick or set the map of the road that
the vehicles of that stop is taking to reach the destination with respective time.
ο Corrected in 1 st amendment.
b. If the stuck or set up the map or time according to sub article –a, is being changed, then the ordered
personnel of authorized personnel must inform every passenger.', 32, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Necessity to inform about the route map & time of departure & arrival)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.33', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '107', 'Necessity to keep the seat well protected', 'Necessity to keep the seat well protected', 'a. It will be the duty or responsibility of every vehicle owner or the manager to keep 4 extra seats for the
disabled people & two seats for women in every local route of public vehicle.
b. It will be the duty of every vehicle owner or the manager to keep two extra seats for parliament members
& women each in every public vehicle running long route. But such extra seats will be only for
four hours before the time of departure.
c. The ticket bought by any parliament member as indicated by sub article –b, can’t be handled to any other
passenger.', 33, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Necessity to keep the seat well protected)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.34', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '108', 'Safe guards can be kept', 'Safe guards can be kept', 'If the owner or the manager of any medium or long route transportation service fe els the necessity of
safe guards for the passengers & the vehicle , s/he can request to HMG for providing such and if HMG feels
that it really needs then it may provide the necessary number of safe guards.', 34, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Safe guards can be kept)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.35', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '109', 'Improper behavior should not be done', 'Improper behavior should not be done', 'No one should behavior improperly with the passengers, driver, conductor or the safe guards.', 35, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Improper behavior should not be done)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.36', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '110', 'Smoking is not allowed in public vehicles', 'Smoking is not allowed in public vehicles', 'Smoking shouldn’t be done in public vehicles.', 36, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Smoking is not allowed in public vehicles)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.37', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '111', 'No one should talk with driver', 'No one should talk with driver', 'No one should talk or do or allow to talk or do anything to the driver while s/he is driving .', 37, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (No one should talk with driver)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.38', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '112', 'Necessity to return the found out things', 'Necessity to return the found out things', 'The things found out in the public vehicle should be given to the vehicle owner or manager within 24
hours. And s/he also should submit such things to the authorized personnel o r Yatayat Byawasthapan Sangh
office within 24 hours of receiving it.', 38, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Necessity to return the found out things)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.39', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '113', 'Passengers shouldn’t be rejected', 'Passengers shouldn’t be rejected', 'If the public vehicle whether express or other running long or medium route has empty seat
shouldn’t reject the passengers to get in.', 39, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Passengers shouldn’t be rejected)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5.40', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:5', 2, 'rule', '114', 'Special Right of HMG', 'Special Right of HMG', 'No matter whatever is written in the Act, if any vehicle owner or manager wants to drive the vehicle
in certain route for specific time, HMG can let it.', 40, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VI (Special Right of HMG)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', NULL, 1, 'chapter', 'PART:VII', '', NULL, 'CONTROL OVER TRANSPORTATION', 6, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '115', 'Decision of speed of vehicle', 'Decision of speed of vehicle', 'a. If the Department feels that any certain place needs a pa rticular speed of vehicle, it can limit the speed &
prohibit to drive over it, In such places, speed more than decided should not be used.
b. In such speed decided public places, according to sub article –a, Dep artment should stick or set up such
information.
c. But, sub article –a, will not be effective for fire brigade, ambulance etc. But, such
vehicles should use a special type of sound to make other vehicle & pedestrians know it or alert them.', 0, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Decision of speed of vehicle)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '116', 'Weight of vehicle', 'Weight of vehicle', 'If some public places, Department may determine the weight of v ehicle. In such weight determined
places, the over weight vehicles shouldn’t be driven or shouldn’t be allowed to be driven either.', 1, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Weight of vehicle)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '117', 'Determination of capacity of passenger & carriage in vehicle', 'Determination of capacity of passenger & carriage in vehicle', 'a. Department should determine the capacity of passenger & carriage in vehicle & publish it for the general
people’ s information.
b. The people or carriage over the determined limit according to sub article –a, should not be put in the
vehicle.', 2, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Determination of capacity of passenger & carriage in vehicle)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.3', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '118', 'Driving can be prohibited', 'Driving can be prohibited', 'No matter what is written in this Act elsewhere, Depa rtment may prohibit to drive in some places for
the public security & the welfare of general people. To inform this, Department should stick, hang or make
ordered personnel set up in such prohibited places.', 3, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Driving can be prohibited)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.4', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '119', 'Stick, Hang or set up the symbol of traffic', 'Stick, Hang or set up the symbol of traffic', 'a. If the Department feels, it may stick hang or make ordered pers onnel set up the internationally practiced
traffic signs with proper color, shape & model in necessary public places.
b. The traffic signs stuck, hanged, or set up as mentioned in sub ar ticle – a, should not be removed,
changed, erased, torn or scribbled over it except the Department itself or the authorized.', 4, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Stick, Hang or set up the symbol of traffic)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.5', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '120', 'Traffic signs to be obeyed', 'Traffic signs to be obeyed', 'a. A driver should drive obeying traffic signs.
b. All the traffic signs to be obeyed by the driver will be as determined.', 5, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Traffic signs to be obeyed)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.6', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '121', 'Determination of parking area & bus park', 'Determination of parking area & bus park', 'The authorized officer should determine the place for making pa rking area & bus stop without
interrupting the main road, consulting the officers of local authority of the District.', 6, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Determination of parking area & bus park)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.7', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '122', 'Vehicle shouldn’t be parked in harmful way', 'Vehicle shouldn’t be parked in harmful way', 'a. No vehicle should be parked in such a way effecting general people & other vehicle.
b. If any vehicle breaks down on the road while driving & is not in condition to be taken anywhere, it
should be parked safely in left bank of the road & it should light th e red light or reflector so that
everyone or any vehicle can easily notice it at night.', 7, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Vehicle shouldn’t be parked in harmful way)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.8', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '123', 'Men should not be kept in other parts', 'Men should not be kept in other parts', 'No driver, vehicle owner or manager should keep the passengers in other part than the given seats on
the long & medium route vehicle 7 only in seats & inside the vehicle in local vehicles.', 8, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Men should not be kept in other parts)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.9', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '124', 'Nothing should be done which may effect the driver', 'Nothing should be done which may effect the driver', 'No one should put stuffs or stand or disturb in any other way to the driver in driver cabin .', 9, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Nothing should be done which may effect the driver)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.10', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '125', 'Transportation should not be interrupted', 'Transportation should not be interrupted', 'No one should keep things or park vehicle in the public places effecting other people or vehicle while
transporting. But, in case if someone has to keep things in public places , firstly s/he has to take approval
from the local police station.', 10, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Transportation should not be interrupted)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.11', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '126', 'Sign should be kept while digging up the public places', 'Sign should be kept while digging up the public places', 'a. If someone has to dig in the public place for certain reason, s/he has to take permission from the local
police station.
b. While giving permission as accorded by sub article –a, the appl icant should be made to keep a sign to
check any accident due to it in that certain place.', 11, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Sign should be kept while digging up the public places)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.12', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '127', 'Sign should be kept in vehicle', 'Sign should be kept in vehicle', 'Any public vehicle carrying dangerous carriages should keep sign in the vehicle s o that other general
people 7 vehicles will notice & know it.', 12, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Sign should be kept in vehicle)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.13', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '128', 'Shouldn’t change the route or kidnap the passengers', 'Shouldn’t change the route or kidnap the passengers', 'a. When the driver is driving smoothly on the route no one should threaten or use any kind of power to
change the route of the vehicle.
b. No one should kidnap the passengers & declare a ransom for freeing the kidnapped passengers.', 13, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Shouldn’t change the route or kidnap the passengers)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.14', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '129', 'The victims & vehicle in accident should not be harmed', 'The victims & vehicle in accident should not be harmed', 'No one should harm, steal, snatch the things & beat any victims, passengers or worker s of the vehicle
which has met with an accident.', 14, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (The victims & vehicle in accident should not be harmed)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.15', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '130', 'Helmet & Belt while driving', 'Helmet & Belt while driving', 'a. As inscribed, while driving, the driver & the front sitter must tie safety belt.
b. In motorcycle & any other two wheeler vehicle, the driver & the next sitter must wear helmet.', 15, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Helmet & Belt while driving)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.16', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '131', 'Show when asked for', 'Show when asked for', 'a. If any police or transportation examiner wants to see the driving license from a driver, s/he must shoe it.
b. If any police or transportation examiner wants to see the vehicl e registration certificate of any vehicle or
road permit license of any public vehicle for investigation, the driver or the vehicle owner or the manager
must show them.', 16, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Show when asked for)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.17', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '132', 'Vehicle should be stopped', 'Vehicle should be stopped', 'Driver should stop vehicle for some time in following reason:
a. If any police or transportation examiner signs or orders to.
b. If the pet animal gets uncontrolled & the keeper signs or requests to.
c. If the vehicle has damaged any man, animal or property during as accident.
d. If the people are crossing the road in zebra crossing or the traffic light signs to stop in cross roads.', 17, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Vehicle should be stopped)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.18', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '133', 'Duty of a driver while the accident occurs', 'Duty of a driver while the accident occurs', 'a. If anyone gets injured due to vehicle accident, the driver, conduct or, safe guards or any other workers of
the vehicle has to manage for the immediate medical service.
b. If there is no police where the accident has occurred according t o sub article –a, the driver must inform
the police station nearby. If any policeman asks question relating to the accident, s/he must answer.', 18, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Duty of a driver while the accident occurs)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.19', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '134', 'Investigation of the vehicle involved in accident', 'Investigation of the vehicle involved in accident', 'If the policemen feel that the vehicle that has been the doer & other affected by the accident need to
be examined, then they can make the vehicle to be admitted to them or can go on the spot.', 19, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Investigation of the vehicle involved in accident)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.20', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '135', 'Vehicles to be driven in left side', 'Vehicles to be driven in left side', 'a. While driving in the public places except some prescribed places, the driver should take the left side of
the road.
b. If any vehicle has to overtake the front vehicle, the driver ha s to show sign to the another driver of the
front vehicle & if s/he gives permission, then the driver should t ake the right side if the road & overtake
the front vehicle. In this way, while giving permission to take ov er, the front vehicle’s driver has to see
the condition.', 20, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Vehicles to be driven in left side)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.21', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '136', 'Necessity to walk in footpath', 'Necessity to walk in footpath', 'If the road has footpath, then the pedestrian should walk in footpath. If the road has no footpath, they
should walk through the bank of the road.', 21, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Necessity to walk in footpath)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.22', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '137', 'Road crossing from the determined way', 'Road crossing from the determined way', 'If the pedestrians have to cross the road, s/he should use zebra cr ossing, subway, overhead bridge or
any other determined way.', 22, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Road crossing from the determined way)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.23', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '138', 'Domestic animals should not be left', 'Domestic animals should not be left', 'Domestic animals & birds should not be left in public places that can effect while driving & walking.', 23, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Domestic animals should not be left)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.24', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '139', 'Should inform', 'Should inform', 'a. If the authorized personnel, transportation investigator or policeman wants information of any vehicle, its
owner should give him/her.
b. If the information indicated by sub article –a, is related to its driver, conductor, safe guards, or any other
workers on that vehicle, its owner or the manager should make it available immediately.', 24, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Should inform)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.25', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '140', 'Mobile Investigator', 'Mobile Investigator', 'a. To investigate either this Act is being obeyed or not policemen or transportation investigator may do the
mobile investigation.
b. While doing the mobile investigation as mentioned by sub article –a , if the investigator finds anyone
doing things mentioned in Article 164, s/he will be punished as mentioned in the same article.', 25, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Mobile Investigator)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.26', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '141', 'No one should give his/her driving license to other', 'No one should give his/her driving license to other', 'A driver can’t give his/her driving license to other to drive.', 26, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (No one should give his/her driving license to other)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.27', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '142', 'Shouldn’t use liquor or drugs', 'Shouldn’t use liquor or drugs', 'A driver use liquor or drugs while driving the vehicle.', 27, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Shouldn’t use liquor or drugs)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.28', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '143', 'Lights should be on while driving at night', 'Lights should be on while driving at night', 'While driving as night or on the foggy time, lights on the vehicle should be on.', 28, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Lights should be on while driving at night)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.29', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '144', 'Shouldn’t be driven in bad condition', 'Shouldn’t be driven in bad condition', 'No one should drive the vehicle, which has got damaged parts & is in bad condition.', 29, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Shouldn’t be driven in bad condition)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.30', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '145', 'Necessary help', 'Necessary help', 'Any vehicle should help the vehicle or the victim who has been in accident.', 30, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Necessary help)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.31', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '146', 'Doing & making do the advertisement', 'Doing & making do the advertisement', 'Department should manage to make the programs relating to traf fic signs to make general people
know about it in time to time & check accident.', 31, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Doing & making do the advertisement)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6.32', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:6', 2, 'rule', '147', 'Shouldn’t drive carefully', 'Shouldn’t drive carefully', 'No driver should drive carelessly.', 32, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART:VII (Shouldn’t drive carefully)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:7', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', NULL, 1, 'chapter', 'PART: VIII', '', NULL, 'RELATING TO AN INSURANCE', 7, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: VIII', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:7.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:7', 2, 'rule', '148', 'Vehicle Insurance to be done', 'Vehicle Insurance to be done', 'a. The vehicle owner or the manager should do the vehicle insurance of every vehicle in prescribed way.
b. If any vehicle has not done its insurance as indicated by sub a rticle –a, then the vehicle registration
certificate will not be renewed & moreover in public vehicle, l icense of transportation service’s
registration & route permit will not be given.', 0, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: VIII (Vehicle Insurance to be done)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:7.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:7', 2, 'rule', '149', 'Insurance of a driver, safe guards & other workers', 'Insurance of a driver, safe guards & other workers', 'a. The vehicle owner or the manager should do the accidental insurance of all the workers of public vehicle:
driver, conductor, safe guards & other workers in prescribed insurance amount.
b. If the driver, conductor, safe guards or other workers lost some parts of their body or their lives in the
accident, the insured amount will be given either to themselves or the closest heir.
c. If the transportation service has been started without doing insuran ce of driver, conductor, safe guards &
other workers as indicated by sub article –a, the vehicle owner or the manager will have to give the
compensation if there has been any physical loss in accident to either themselves or to their rightful heir
in accordance to sub article –a.', 1, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: VIII (Insurance of a driver, safe guards & other workers)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:7.2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:7', 2, 'rule', '150', 'Insurance of passengers', 'Insurance of passengers', 'a. The vehicle owner or the manager of any route has to do the acci dental insurance of passenger of
prescribed amount.
b. If the passenger loses any parts of his/her body in accident, s /he will get the insurance amount. But s/he
dies in vehicle accident; the rightful heir will get the compensation.
c. If any public vehicle has not done passenger’s insurance as mentioned in sub article –a, & meets with an
accident, the rightful owner or the manager should give compensation to the victims or to the rightful
heir of the dead as indicated by sub article – a.', 2, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: VIII (Insurance of passengers)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:7.3', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:7', 2, 'rule', '151', 'Insurance of passenger’s luggage', 'Insurance of passenger’s luggage', 'a. The vehicle owner or the manager who has conducted the transportation service must do the insurance of
passenger’s bundle of the prescribed amount.
b. No matter what is the value of the bundle of passenger, if it g ets lost or damaged which has not been
insured as indicated by sub article –a, if the lost bundle costs mor e than prescribed insurance amount, the
vehicle owner or the manager will be not responsible for it.
c. If the passenger’s bundle is lost or damaged in the vehicle which has not done the bundle’s insurance, as
indicated by sub article –a, but has already started the transport ation service, the vehicle owner or the
manager must give the insurance amount as compensation as indi cated by sub article –a to the passenger
or to the rightful heir', 3, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: VIII (Insurance of passenger’s luggage)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:7.4', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:7', 2, 'rule', '152', 'Insurance of third party', 'Insurance of third party', 'a. The vehicle owner or the manager should do the insurance of third party with prescribed amount to give
compensation to the third party if the accident causes damages or loss to them
b. If the third party is effected by the accident, then suffere r or the rightful heir will get the compensation
according to sub article –a.
c. If the vehicle has not done the third party’s insurance ass indi cated by sub article-a, & meets with as
accident, the vehicle owner or the manager should give the suff erer or the rightful heir the compensation
for the loss caused by their vehicle as indicated by sub article –a.', 4, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: VIII (Insurance of third party)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:8', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', NULL, 1, 'chapter', 'PART: IX', '', NULL, 'FUNCTION, DUTY & RIGHT', 8, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: IX', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z')
;

INSERT INTO document_nodes (id, document_id, parent_id, depth, node_type, identifier, title, heading, content, position, citation, created_at) VALUES
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:8.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:8', 2, 'rule', '153', 'Function, duty & right of the Department', 'Function, duty & right of the Department', 'The function, duty & right of the Department are as follows: -
a. To determine the policy doing studies & investigations on financial & technical parts for conducting the
Transportation service more systematic & effective way.
b. To direct the individual, Form, company or organization related to tr ansportation service for the
development & facility of transportation.
c. To determine the primary level of carrying goods & directing the related individual, Form, company or
organization to transport the primary level of goods.
d. To determine the route & fare of the public vehicle or the basis of pressure/density of passenger.
e. To manage keeping the internationally practiced traffic signs in public places.
f. To determine the speed, weight & number of passengers in the vehicle.
g. To determine & prepare the necessary measurement for examining the technical stage & formation of the
vehicle.
h. To determine the procedure of examination & subject of it for the drivers.
i. To do other works to improve the transportation service.', 0, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: IX (Function, duty & right of the Department)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:8.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:8', 2, 'rule', '154', 'Transportation Management Committee', 'Transportation Management Committee', '(TMC)
In every area, to conduct the transportation service in managed wa y; following members will form
Transportation Management Committee.
a. Main/Head District Office (District where TMC is located.) - Chief
b. Main District Police Office - member
c. One on behalf of people engaged in transportation business - member
d. One on behalf of Yatayat Majdoor - member
e. Main, Transportation Management Office - Member- secretary', 1, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: IX (Transportation Management Committee)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:8.2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:8', 2, 'rule', '155', 'Function, duty & right of Transportation Management Committee', 'Function, duty & right of Transportation Management Committee', 'The function, duty & right of Transportation Management Committee are as follows:
a. To make the local people involve in the transportation service so tha t the transportation service in their
area is comfortable.
b. If the road is not ready in their part for transportation servic e, it should write an application to determine
the fare of the temporary route.
c. To investigate or make other man investigate if the route ha ving route permit has been used or not for
transportation & if it has been renewed or not in time to time.
d. To investigate or order other to investigate if the vehicles running in their area have been doing hfFrkf;
regularly & whether they are giving services staying under this regularly or not.
e. To request the Department to determine the route if it f eels that more transportation service should be
started after doing the investigation on the number of the vehicles & density of passengers.
f. To do other extra works to make the transportation service well managed in their area.', 2, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: IX (Function, duty & right of Transportation Management Committee)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:8.3', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:8', 2, 'rule', '156', 'Examination Committee', 'Examination Committee', 'a. To examine the applicant if s/he is able is able of being a driver as mentioned in Article 49, a committee
of following members will form:-
a.I Main, Transportation Management Office - chief
a.II HMG appointed Police officer - member.
a.III HMG appointed specialist - member
b. The name of successful candidates in the examination for driv ing license should be submitted to the
authorized personnel & request him/her to give them the driving li censes. This is to be done by the
committee formed by sub article –a.
c. The meeting of the committee formed by sub article –a will be fixed by the committee.
d. The examination taken by the committee of sub article –a, will be on the prescribed subject & procedure
by the Department.', 3, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: IX (Examination Committee)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:8.4', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:8', 2, 'rule', '157', 'Appointment of the transportation investigator', 'Appointment of the transportation investigator', 'HMG may appoint an investigator to check whether the vehicle has been used or not on the basis of
this Act & also if the terms & conditions of this Act have been fulfilled or not.', 4, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: IX (Appointment of the transportation investigator)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:8.5', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:8', 2, 'rule', '158', 'Function, duty & right of transportation investigation', 'Function, duty & right of transportation investigation', 'The function, duty & right of a transportation investigator are as follows: -
a. To investigate if the public vehicle involved in public transportat ion service has been using the route or
not.
b. To investigate if the public vehicles are taking the passengers & the carriage according to the weight
capacity or not.
c. To examine if the public vehicles have done hfFrkf; regularly or not & whether they have been
registered in transportation service office.
d. To examine the license of driver & conductor, the passenger names list & whether they are charging the
fixed ticket fare or not or whether they are driving in fixed speed or not.
e. To investigate whether the driver, conductor, the vehicle owner or t he manager are obeying this Act or
not.', 5, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: IX (Function, duty & right of transportation investigation)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:8.6', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:8', 2, 'rule', '159', 'License for establishing training center, & workshop', 'License for establishing training center, & workshop', 'a. Any individual, Form, company or organization wanting to establish drivi ng training center, automobile
workshop for constructing body parts of bus or truck must write an application to the Department.
b. The applicant wanting to take permission as indicated by sub arti cle –a, must include the prescribed
custom charge along with the application.
c. The Department should first examine whether the application can r eally do what is being said in the
application as mentioned in sub article –b or not, then only it may give the license.', 6, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: IX (License for establishing training center, & workshop)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:9', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', NULL, 1, 'chapter', 'PART: X', '', NULL, 'MANAGEMENT RELATING TO PUNISHMENT', 9, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: X', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:9.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:9', 2, 'rule', '160', 'Punishment', 'Punishment', 'a. If the authorized personnel finds anyone using another number plate ra ther than the number written on
the registration certificate or without using number plate or le tting other use in such a way, then the
officer should keep such person in jail for 6 months or charge fine from Rs.5000/- to RS. 15000/- &
confiscate the vehicle.
b. The authorized personnel may fine the doer or one letting other do following deeds:-
b.I Fines ranging from Rs.500/- to Rs.1000/- for disobeying or letting ot her disobey the rules on Article
12, 45 or 117.
b.II Fine ranging from RS. 1000/- to Rs.5000/- for breaking or making other b reak the rules on Article
14, 29, 39, 75, 93, 96, 125 or 129.
b.III Fine ranging from Rs.2000/- to Rs.10000/- for breaking or making other brea k the rules on Article
159.
c. Apart from the sub article –a & -b, the authorized personnel may fine the person breaking or making
other break the rules & regulations & orders of this Act from Rs.200/- to Rs.1000/-.
d. The court may fine the person breaking or making other break the rul es on Article 125, upto Rs.25000/-
or 5 years imprisonment or both the punishment and the person being aff ected by such kind of act, may
be given compensation from the doer.
e. The court may fine the person breaking or making other break the rul es on Article 165 of Rs.1000/- or
one year imprisonment or both the punishment & s/he can be made to pa y the compensation for the loss
caused by him/her to the sufferer.
οο οο161.Punishment if someone dies:
a. If a person outside of the vehicle or inside the vehicle dies imm ediately after the moving vehicle hits
stumbles him/her or dies within the given date, the driver wil l be sentenced life imprisonment if the
accident has been done intentionally. But if it is proved that the accident is not a planned one, the doer
will be given imprisonment from 5 to 12 years according to the nature of the accident.
b. If a person outside of the vehicle or inside the vehicle dies immediately after the moving vehicle hits,
stumbles him/her or any other vehicle accident or dies within the given date in the Muluki Ain, but the
driver hasn’t done it intentionally & if it is proved, then also t he man dies or there is the possibility of
dying due to the driver’s carelessness, the driver may be impr isoned from 2 to 10 years according to the
nature of the accident.
c. If the accident doesn’t seem dangerous, but still the person inside or outside the vehicle dies the driver
will be fined Rs.2000/- or imprisoned for one year or both.
d. If The driver without having driving license does the crime as mentioned in sub article –a & -b, s/he will
be given the same punishment with an extra Rs.2000/- fine. But the person who has been
sentenced life imprisoned including his/her entire property will not fined the extra charge.
e. If the person who has been given permission from the vehicle owner or the manger or the responsible
person hits or stumbles the vehicle & s/he dies, such person allowing other to drive will be imprisoned
for two years.
ο 162. Punishment for breaking body parts:
a. If any driver intentionally hits & the person staying inside or outside the vehicle & s/he becomes blind or
impotent due to the accident, the driver will be imprisoned for 8 years & will be fined Rs.10000/-. Except
these two marks, if the victim loses any other parts, the driv er will be imprisoned for 8 years & will be
fined Rs.5000/-. If one among the two same functioning organs becomes usele ss due to the accident, the
driver will b given half punishment of the punishment mentioned above. And if the injury heals & that
part becomes useful, the driver will be fined Rs.5000/-.
b. If the driver without having driving license does the crime as mentioned in sub article –a, s/he will be
given the same punishment with an extra charge of Rs.5000/-.
c. If the person without driving license is given the permission to dr ive by the vehicle owner or any other
responsible person & hits & disables any person staying outside or inside the vehicle, such person
allowing him/her to drive will be fined Rs.2000/-.', 0, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: X (Punishment)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:9.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:9', 2, 'rule', '163', 'Wound expenditure, funeral rites expenditure, compensation for loss', 'Wound expenditure, funeral rites expenditure, compensation for loss', 'a. if someone becomes the victim of the accident, s/he will be given the compensation in the form of wound
expenditure, overcoming loss by the vehicle owner or the manager as follows:-
a.I If someone dies, the rightful heir will get Rs.10000/- as funeral rites expenditure & if the insurance of
third party is not done, the insurance amount as indicated by this Ac t will be given to the affected third
party.
ο Corrected in 1 st amendment.
a.II If the recovery also doesn’t make the affected part useful, & if the insurance of third party has not
been done, the victim will get that third party’s insurance amount as compensation & if the affected part
becomes useful after recovery then wound expenditure will be given.
b. ο Main District Office must make the driver, the vehicle owner or the vehicle owner or the manager pay the
funeral rites expenditure if any passenger dies & if the vict im doesn’t die but gets injured, then s/he has to
pay the wound expenditure.
c. Apart from sub article –a, if any driver drives the vehicl e breaking the rules of this Act & meets with an
accident and injures any person , ο Main District Officer ,
must fine the vehicle owner or the manager of
Rs.2000/-, & should give it to the victim. If the injured person is to get more compensation, then the medical
expenditure given previously will be deducted from the total expenditure.
d. No matter what is written above, among the total percentage of wound expenditure 5% will be paid by
the driver.
e. If the & of expenditure as mentioned in sub article – a & b, can’t be taken even from the driver’s
personal property then it should be taken from the fine paid for himself.
f. As indicated by this Act, the insurance amount to be given by t he insurance company should be
immediately given.', 1, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: X (Wound expenditure, funeral rites expenditure, compensation for loss)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:9.2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:9', 2, 'rule', '164', 'Immediately punished by Transportation Investigator or police', 'Immediately punished by Transportation Investigator or police', 'a. If anyone makes following faults for the 1 st time, s/he will be fined rs. 25/- to Rs.50/- if it is for the 2 nd
time, s/he will be fined Rs. 50/- to Rs.100/-, if it’s for 3 rd time or over it, s/he will be fined Rs.100/- to
Rs.200/- by the transportation investigator or 36Ldf ;xfos k|x/L lg/LIfs bhf{;DDfsf] clWfs[t
