b. If the driver has no money immediately to pay the fine to the inve stigator or policeman as mentioned in
sub article –a, s/he will have to submit the bill & pay to the re lated police office or the authorized
personnel within 24 hours.
ο Corrected in 1 st Amendment.
ο Corrected in 1 st Amendment.
c. No matter what is written in sub article –a, if anyone does the crime as indicated in sub article –a, s/he
can be fined in then & there on the spot .If even 36Ldf ;xfos k|x/L lg/LIfs bhf{;DDfsf]
clWfs[t is not present on the spot, the k|x/L hjfg can also hand over the bill of paying fine exposing
the misdeed to the driver to be paid within 24 hours.
d. While submitting the bill relating to sub article –b & c, the pers on has to get the signature of the officer
who has taken the bill on the photocopy of the bill.
e. If the authorized personnel or the police officer doesn’t get the bi ll relating to sub article –b & c, on
the given time, the authorized personnel may ο suspend following things for maximum one month
with Rs.1000/- fine. If s/he is driver him/herself, it/s his/her dri ving license, if it’s the vehicle owner
or the manager, then it’s their route permit license or transportation service Certificate
ωω ωω f. If no on e pays the fine of the suspended license in given ti me as indicated by sub article –e, then the
authorized personnel may expel/reject such driving license, route per mit license or transportation service
license.', 2, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: X (Immediately punished by Transportation Investigator or police)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', NULL, 1, 'chapter', 'PART: XI', '', NULL, 'MISCELLANEOUS', 10, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: XI', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10', 2, 'rule', '165', 'No damage or loss should be done', 'No damage or loss should be done', 'No one can beat the driver, conductor, safe guards, and other workers i n the vehicle & passengers
stop the vehicle, break the vehicle or any other thing, which may cause loss or damage to the vehicle &
people inside the vehicle.', 0, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: XI (No damage or loss should be done)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10', 2, 'rule', '166', 'Payment to be done by vehicle owner on manager', 'Payment to be done by vehicle owner on manager', 'Except for the damage or loss caused by the driver while driving carelessly & breaking rules, the
vehicle owner or the manager has to pay for the wound expenditure, funer al rites expenditure or
compensation caused by the driver according to this Act.', 1, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: XI (Payment to be done by vehicle owner on manager)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10.2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10', 2, 'rule', '167', 'No punishment', 'No punishment', 'Except Article 161 & 162, in the accident caused being out of the driv er’s control, the driver won’t
be punished.', 2, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: XI (No punishment)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10.3', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10', 2, 'rule', '168', 'Transportation service conducting in competition', 'Transportation service conducting in competition', 'No matter what is written in this Act, the license will not b e given for doing competition while
driving public vehicle in transportation service.
ω But for making the public vehicle comfortable, advantageous reli able , scientific & well managed
,the transportation service offices will be allowed to give service in turn wise.', 3, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: XI (Transportation service conducting in competition)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10.4', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10', 2, 'rule', '169', 'Can be directed', 'Can be directed', 'It will be the duty of every businessman involved in the transpor tation service to obey the direction
given by the HMG’s Department or authorized personnel for making the Transportation business more
effective & the service comfortable & regular.
ο Corrected in 1 st amendment.
ω Added in 1 st amendment.
ω Added in 1 st amendment.', 4, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: XI (Can be directed)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10.5', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10', 2, 'rule', '170', 'Right Delegation', 'Right Delegation', 'According to this Act, the authorized personnel or the Department may delegate some or all the
power to any authorized personnel may be Samiti, officials, Transportation investigator, or police officers', 5, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: XI (Right Delegation)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10.6', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10', 2, 'rule', '171', '(appellate)', '(appellate)', 'a. According to this Act the decision or the orders made by the aut horized personnel , police officers will
be k’g/fj]bg to the Department
b. According to this Act the decision & orders made by the Departm ent will be the k’g/fj]bg at the
court.', 6, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: XI ((appellate))', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10.7', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10', 2, 'rule', '172', 'Limit of complain date & date for apeak', 'Limit of complain date & date for apeak', 'From the date given in Muluki Ain on the crime of death as indicated by Article 161, on the crime of beating,
& on the crime written this Act, within 30 days of such accidents, the complain should be done.
a. Except in the case of Article 161, & 162, for the crime done relating to this Act, appellate should be done
within the 45 days of receiving the decision or the orders.', 7, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: XI (Limit of complain date & date for apeak)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10.8', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10', 2, 'rule', '173', 'Should help', 'Should help', 'If authorized personnel or he transportation investigator seeks help, i t will be the duty of the
policemen & all the other relating to the this field, to make ef fective the rules & other given orders made in
this Act.', 8, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: XI (Should help)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10.9', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10', 2, 'rule', '174', 'Should obey this act by drivers of other vehicles', 'Should obey this act by drivers of other vehicles', 'The driver who doesn’t have to register the vehicle, take the dr iving license all according to this Act,
also should obey the rules made in this Act or the traffic signs given by the order.', 9, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: XI (Should obey this act by drivers of other vehicles)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10.10', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10', 2, 'rule', '175', 'Protection if the intense was good', 'Protection if the intense was good', 'In the works done with the good thought by the authorized personnel or the de legated personnel,
they will not be responsible personally.', 10, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: XI (Protection if the intense was good)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10.11', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_act_2049:10', 2, 'rule', '176', 'Special Right', 'Special Right', 'No matter what is written elsewhere in this Act, for some vehicle, HMG may release from this Act
for a particular time.
