Bus, Truck, Tractor, Fire Brigade, Dodger, Loader, Dumpher, Crane, Roller etc,
Vf08 v
Medium Vehicle: (Related to Article-4)
Mini bus, Mini truck. Jeep, Pickup, Van, crane, Tractor, Roller etc.
Vf08 u
