Car, Jeep, Pickup, Motorcycle, Scooter, Tempo, Power Tiller etc.
σ Statement: 2
(Relating to Article 6,7,8,9,10 & 11)
NUMBER PLATE OF VEHICLE
Vf08 s
Public Vehicle (Relating to sub article -e of Article 6):
White letter & number should be written in black plate
/handwrite But from onwards the tempos & microbuses running in Ring road & out of Ring road should
keep white numberplate with black letter & number.
Vf08 v
Tourist Vehicle (Relating to sub article –b of Article 7):
White letter & number should be written in green plate.
Vf08 u
Private Vehicle (Relating to sub article –c of Article 8):
σ Changed in statement publishing in the Nepal Gazette on 2056/6/3.
