Blue letter & number should be written in yellow plate.
Vf08 r
Diplomatic Vehicle (Relating to sub article –b of Article 11):
White letter & number should be written in blue plate.', 15, 'Vehicle & Transportation Act, 2049, PART: XI (Rejection & Defense)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z')
