being in order.', 35, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-3, Clause (5)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4.36', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'A bus which operates under the direct service s hall be allowed to
operate for up to Five years after the date of its initial operation, and thereafter,
it may be allowed to operate for up to additional T hree years after carrying out
test or examination of the mechanical and technical condition of such a motor
vehicle and other necessary matters each year.', 36, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-3, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4.37', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4', 3, 'clause', '(3)', '', NULL, 'A bus which operates under the express service shall be allowed to
operate for up to Eight years after the date of its initial operation, and
thereafter, it may be allowed to operate for up to additional Four years after
carrying out test or examination of the mechanical and technical condition of
such a motor vehicle and other necessary matters each year.', 37, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-3, Clause (3)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4.38', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4', 3, 'clause', '(4)', '', NULL, 'A mini bus which operates under the express ser vice shall be
allowed to operate for up to Eight years after the date of its initial operation,
and thereafter, it may be allowed to operate for up to additional Seven years
after carrying out test or examination of the mechanical and technical condition
of such a motor vehicle and other necessary matters each year.', 38, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-3, Clause (4)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4.39', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4', 3, 'clause', '(4a)', '', NULL, '14 A micro bus which operates under the express servi ce on a long
route and a medium route shall be allowed to operat e for up to Five years after
the date of its initial operation, and thereafter, it may be allowed to operate for
up to additional Three years after carrying out tes t or examination of the
mechanical and technical condition of such a motor vehicle and other
necessary matters each year.', 39, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-3, Clause (4a)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4.40', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4', 3, 'clause', '(4b)', '', NULL, '15 A local bus service, mini bus and micro bus operat ing on long,
medium and short routes must have the provision of, inter alia , primary
treatment including necessary medicines and aids an d a fire extinguisher, in
addition to the other matters set forth in this Rule.', 40, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-3, Clause (4b)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4.41', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4', 3, 'clause', '(4c)', '', NULL, '16 Notwithstanding anything contained elsewhere in th ese
Rules, permission may be given to operate the dir ect bus service in day
service and night service and to operate the expres s bus service, local bus
service, mini bus and micro bus in day service only . Provided that, in the case
of the micro bus, route permit may be issued only f or a distance of a maximum
of 300 kilometers.', 41, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-3, Clause (4c)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4.42', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4', 3, 'clause', '(5)', '', NULL, 'For the purposes of Sub-section (4) of Section 6 of the Act, the
speed of the following motor vehicles is hereby determined as follows:
(a) Car, jeep, van and pick up: a maximum of 80 kil ometers
per hour,
(b) Tempo, scooter, power tiller and tractor: a max imum of 40
kilometers per hour,
(c) Motor cycle: a maximum of 50 kilometers per hou r,
14 Inserted by the First Amendment.
15 Inserted by the First Amendment.
16 Inserted by the First Amendment.
(d) Bus, mini bus, truck and mini truck: a maximum of 50
kilometers per hour on a hilly road and a maximum o f 70
kilometers per hour on a plane/surface road.
Provided that, any motor vehicle must not be
driven at a speed exceeding 40 kilometers per hour in an
area with dense settlement.', 42, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-3, Clause (5)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4.43', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4', 3, 'clause', '(6)', '', NULL, 'The Department may determine the speed of motor vehicles other
than those referred to in Sub-rule (5) and, in the case of the motor vehicles
whose speed has been determined, alter the speed of those vehicles, having
regard, inter alia , to the geographical situation and the condition of road.', 43, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-3, Clause (6)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4.44', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4', 3, 'clause', '(7)', '', NULL, 'Notwithstanding anything contained in Sub-rules (5) and (6), if any
notice or signal relating to the speed of motor veh icles in any place pursuant to
Section 115 of the Act, motor vehicles must be driv en in such a place at the
speed mentioned in that notice or signal.', 44, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-3, Clause (7)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4.45', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4', 3, 'clause', '(8)', '', NULL, 'A driver driving a passenger motor vehicle shal l depart the motor
vehicle and arrive at the destination at the time s pecified in the schedule
determined by the Office issuing the route permit.', 45, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-3, Clause (8)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4.46', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.4', 3, 'clause', '(9)', '', NULL, 'Except in the case of a circumstance beyond con trol, no motor
vehicle must be taken to the destination in such a manner as to be later than the
time referred to in Sub-rule (8) or as causing inco nvenience to passengers or
abandon them.', 46, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-3, Clause (9)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.5', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3', 2, 'rule', '19', 'Tourist motor vehicle', 'Tourist motor vehicle', NULL, 5, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-3 (Tourist motor vehicle)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.5.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:3.5', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'The following motor vehicle shall be registered as
a tourist motor vehicle pursuant to Section 7 of the Act:
(a) A motor vehicle registered in the name of a tou rism
entrepreneur licensed to carry on tourism business
pursuant to the laws in force,
(b) A motor vehicle used in tourism business by a t ourism
entrepreneur licensed to carry on tourism business
pursuant to the laws in force despite that the moto r vehicle
has been purchased by a loan disbursed by a financi al
institution and registered in the name of the finan cial
institution.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-3, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z')
;

