the Act, out of the persons who have made applicati ons pursuant to Sub-rule', 2, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-4, Clause (3)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.0.3', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.0', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, '.', 3, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-4, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.0.4', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.0', 3, 'clause', '(4)', '', NULL, 'While issuing the driving license pursuant to S ub-rule (3), the
driving license may be issued separately for a priv ate motor vehicle and a
public motor vehicle.', 4, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-4, Clause (4)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.0.5', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.0', 3, 'clause', '(5)', '', NULL, 'Notwithstanding anything contained elsewhere in this Rules, upon
the commencement of these Rules, no license shall b e issued to a person who
has completed the age of Sixty years 17 to drive heavy and medium public
motor vehicles.', 5, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-4, Clause (5)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.0.6', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.0', 3, 'clause', '(6)', '', NULL, 'No driving license shall be issued to drive med ium and heavy motor
vehicles other than tractors 18 until Two years have passed after starting to drive
a light motor vehicle.
19 20A. To be provided in form of Electronic Smart Car d : A driving license
pursuant to Rule 20 shall be issued in form of Electronic Smart Card.', 6, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-4, Clause (6)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4', 2, 'rule', '21', 'Driving license register', 'Driving license register', 'The Office shall prepare and maintain a driving
