Schedule-21 and accompanied by the fees as referred to in Schedule-3, for the
renewal of the driving license pursuant to Section 56 of the Act.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-4, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.3.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.3', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'While making an application for the renewal of a driving license
pursuant to Sub-rule (1), it must be accompanied al so by a physical fitness
certificate in the format as referred to in Schedule-18.', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-4, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.3.2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.3', 3, 'clause', '(3)', '', NULL, 'If an application is made for the renewal of a driving license
pursuant to Sub-rule (1) and the Office, upon makin g necessary examination,
finds it appropriate to renew the driving license, the Office shall renew the
driving license, subject to the Act and the other p rovisions set forth in these
Rules and maintain records thereof in the driving l icense register as referred to
in Schedule-19 .21', 2, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-4, Clause (3)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.3.3', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.3', 3, 'clause', '(4)', '', NULL, 'If a driving license issued by one Office is r enewed by another
Office pursuant to Sub-rule (3), the Office making such renewal shall give
information thereof to the Office issuing that driv ing license as promptly as
possible, and if such information is received, the Office issuing that driving
license shall mention the matter of renewal of that driving license in the
register as referred to in Schedule-23.', 3, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-4, Clause (4)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.4', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4', 2, 'rule', '24', 'Duplicate copy of driving license', 'Duplicate copy of driving license', NULL, 4, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-4 (Duplicate copy of driving license)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.4.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.4', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'If it is required to obtain a duplicate
copy of the driving license owing to the occurrence of a circumstance as set
forth in Section 62 of the Act, the concerned drive r shall make an application
to the Office which has issued the driving license in the form as referred to in
Schedule-24 and accompanied by the fees as referred to in Schedule-3.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-4, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.4.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.4', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'If an application is made pursuant to Sub-rule (1) and the Office,
upon making necessary examination in relation to th e application, is of the
opinion that it is necessary to issue a duplicate c opy of the driving license as
per the request of the applicant, the Office shall issue a duplicate copy of the
21 Amended by the First Amendment.
driving license, subject to the Act and the other p rovisions set forth in these
Rules, and record that matter in the driving licens e register as referred to in
Schedule-19.', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-4, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.5', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4', 2, 'rule', '25', 'Notice of death of driver to be given', 'Notice of death of driver to be given', NULL, 5, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-4 (Notice of death of driver to be given)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.5.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.5', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'In the event of death of a person
who has obtained a driving license pursuant to the Act and these Rules, the
close relative of the deceased shall obtain a death certificate in relation to the
deceased in accordance with the laws in force and s ubmit a copy thereof to the
Office which has issued the driving license.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-4, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.5.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:4.5', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'While giving information of death pursuant to S ub-rule (1), the
driving license of the deceased must also be submit ted if it is available, and
upon receipt of such information, the concerned Off ice shall obliterate his or
her records from the driving license register as referred to in Schedule-19.', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-4, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', NULL, 1, 'chapter', 'Chapter-5', '', NULL, 'Provisions relating to conductor license', 5, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-5', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5', 2, 'rule', '26', 'Application for conductor license', 'Application for conductor license', NULL, 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-5 (Application for conductor license)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.0.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.0', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'A person who intends to obtain the
conductor license pursuant to Section 66 of the Act shall make an application
to any Office in the format as referred to in Sched ule-25 and accompanied by
the fees as referred to in Schedule-3.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-5, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.0.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.0', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'While making an application pursuant to Sub-rul e (1), it must be
accompanied also by a physical fitness certificate making certification in the
format as referred to in Schedule-26 by a medical d octor recognized by the
Government of Nepal in relation to the physical fitness of the applicant.', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-5, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.0.2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.0', 3, 'clause', '(3)', '', NULL, 'If an application is made for the conductor lic ense pursuant to Sub-
rule (1), the Office shall issue the conductor license upon fulfilling the
procedures set forth in Section 67 of the Act.', 2, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-5, Clause (3)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5', 2, 'rule', '27', 'Conductor license register', 'Conductor license register', 'The Office issuing the conductor license shall
prepare and maintain a conductor license register i n the format as referred to in
Schedule-27 in order to maintain updated records of the conductor license
issued pursuant to Rule 26.', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-5 (Conductor license register)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5', 2, 'rule', '28', 'Renewal of conductor license', 'Renewal of conductor license', NULL, 2, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-5 (Renewal of conductor license)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.2.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.2', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'A conductor shall have to make an
application to any Office, in the format as referre d to in Schedule-28 and
accompanied by the fees as referred to in Schedule- 3, for the renewal of the
conductor license pursuant to Section 68 of the Act.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-5, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.2.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.2', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'While making an application for the renewal of conductor license
pursuant to Sub-rule (1), it must be accompanied al so by a fitness certificate of
the applicant in the format as referred to in Schedule-26.', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-5, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.2.2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.2', 3, 'clause', '(3)', '', NULL, 'If an application is made pursuant to Sub-rule (1) and the Office,
upon making necessary examination, finds it appropr iate to renew the
conductor license, the Office shall renew the condu ctor license, subject to the
Act and the other provisions set forth in these Rul es and maintain records
thereof in the conductor license renewal register as referred to in Schedule-29.', 2, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-5, Clause (3)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.2.3', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.2', 3, 'clause', '(4)', '', NULL, 'If a conductor license issued by one Office is renewed by another
Office pursuant to Sub-rule (3), the Office making such renewal shall give
information thereof to the Office issuing that cond uctor license as promptly as
possible, and if such information is received, the Office issuing that conductor
license shall mention the matter of renewal of that conductor license in the
register as referred to in Schedule-30.', 3, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-5, Clause (4)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.3', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5', 2, 'rule', '29', 'Duplicate copy of conductor license', 'Duplicate copy of conductor license', NULL, 3, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-5 (Duplicate copy of conductor license)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.3.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.3', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'If it is required to obtain a duplicate
copy of the conductor license, the concerned conduc tor shall make an
application to the Office which has issued the cond uctor license in the format
as referred to in Schedule-31 and accompanied by th e fees as referred to in
Schedule-3.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-5, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.3.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:5.3', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'If an application is made pursuant to Sub-rule (1) and the Office,
upon making necessary examination in relation to th e application, is of the
opinion that it is necessary to issue a duplicate c opy of the conductor license as
per the request of the applicant, the Office shall iss ue a duplicate copy of the
conductor license, subject to the Act and the other provisions set forth in these
Rules, and record that matter in the conductor lice nse register as referred to in
Schedule-27.', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-5, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', NULL, 1, 'chapter', 'Chapter-6', '', NULL, 'Transport management', 6, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '30', 'Application for route permit', 'Application for route permit', NULL, 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Application for route permit)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.0.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.0', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'The owner or manager of motor vehicle
who intends to obtain the route permit pursuant to Section 76 of the Act shall
make an application to the concerned Office in the format as referred to in
Schedule-32 and accompanied by the fees as referred to in Schedule-3, for the
route permit.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.0.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.0', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'While making an application pursuant to Sub-rul e (1) for the route
permit, it must be accompanied also by duplicate co pies of appointment letters
given by the owner or manager of motor vehicle conc erned to the drivers and
conductors, in the format as referred to in Schedule-62.', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.0.2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.0', 3, 'clause', '(3)', '', NULL, 'If the owner or manager of motor vehicle using a route permit
intends to cease to operate the motor vehicle on th at route but to operate it on
another route, the application must also be accompa nied by a letter of consent
given by the Office which has issued the previous r oute permit, for obtaining
the route permit for the operation of the motor vehicle.', 2, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (3)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '31', 'Route change', 'Route change', NULL, 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Route change)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.1.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.1', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'If the owner or manager of motor vehicle concer ned
intends to use a route other than the route mention ed in the route permit issued
pursuant to Section 77 of the Act, the owner or man ager shall make an
application to the Office which has issued the rout e permit in the format as
referred to in Schedule-33 and accompanied by the f ees as referred to in
Schedule-3, for using that other route pursuant to Section 79 of the Act.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.1.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.1', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'If an application is made pursuant to Sub-rule (1), the Office shall
issue a new route permit pursuant to Section 79 of the Act.', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '32', 'Ad hoc route permit', 'Ad hoc route permit', NULL, 2, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Ad hoc route permit)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.2.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.2', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'If the owner or manager of motor vehicle intend s to
obtain the ad hoc route permit pursuant to Section 81 of the Act, th e owner or
manager shall make an application to the concerned Office in the format as
referred to in Schedule-34 and accompanied by the f ees as referred to in
Schedule-3.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.2.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.2', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'If an application is made pursuant to Sub-rule (1), the Office shall
inquire into the matter and issue the ad hoc route permit in the format as
referred to in Schedule-35 for the period as referred to in Section 81 of the Act.', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.3', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '33', 'Standards of public motor vehicles providing transport service on medium', 'Standards of public motor vehicles providing transport service on medium', 'and long routes : The standards of public motor vehicles providing th e
transport service on medium and long routes pursuan t to Section 82 of the Act
shall be as prescribed by the Government of Nepal b y a Notification in the
Nepal Gazette.', 3, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Standards of public motor vehicles providing transport service on medium)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.4', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '34', 'Renewal of route permit', 'Renewal of route permit', NULL, 4, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Renewal of route permit)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.4.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.4', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'An application must be made to the Office
which has issued a route permit, in the format as referred to in Schedule-36 and
accompanied by the fees as referred to in Schedule- 3, for the renewal of the
route permit pursuant to Section 36 of the Act.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.4.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.4', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'If an application is made pursuant to Sub-rule (1) and the Office,
upon making necessary examination of the applicatio n, finds it appropriate to
renew the route permit, the Office shall renew the route permit, subject to the
Act and the other provisions set forth in these Rules.', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.5', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '35', 'Suspension of route permit', 'Suspension of route permit', NULL, 5, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Suspension of route permit)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.5.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.5', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'The owner or manager of a motor vehicle in
respect whereof a route permit has been issued shal l make an application,
specifying the reason why the motor vehicle is not capable of being plied, to
the Office which has issued that route permit, in t he format as referred to in
Schedule-37, for the suspension of the route permit pursuant to Section 86 of
the Act, prior to the expiration of the period set forth in the route permit issued
pursuant to Sections 77, 79, 80 and 83 of the Act.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.5.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.5', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'If an application is made pursuant to Sub-rule (1), the Office shall,
upon making necessary examination of the applicatio n, suspend the route
permit, pursuant to Section 86 of the Act.', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.5.2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.5', 3, 'clause', '(3)', '', NULL, 'In the case of a motor vehicle other than that mentioned in Sub-rule', 2, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (3)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.5.3', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.5', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, ', the owner or manager of motor vehicle shall su bmit such documents as
may be sought by the Office pursuant to the Act and these Rules. In the event
of failure to produce the documents so sought or su ch documents appearing
doubtful despite their submission, the Office may s uspend the route permit
issued under the Act and these Rules in relation to such a motor vehicle.', 3, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.6', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '36', 'Transmission of route permit', 'Transmission of route permit', 'If the owner or manager of any motor vehicle
having obtained the route permit pursuant to the Ac t and these Rules transmit
the motor vehicle by way of sale or otherwise and t he new owner or manager
of the motor vehicle having obtained such a route p ermit intends to use such a
route permit and makes an application for the trans mission of route permit, the
concerned Office shall execute the transmission of such a route permit.', 6, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Transmission of route permit)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.7', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '37', 'Route permit register', 'Route permit register', 'The records of the route permits, route change perm its,
ad hoc route permits, route permit renewal, route permit suspension and route
permit transmission issued and effected pursuant to the Act and these Rules
shall be maintained in the route permit register as referred to in the Schedule-
38 in an updated manner.', 7, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Route permit register)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.8', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '38', 'Duplicate copy of route permit', 'Duplicate copy of route permit', NULL, 8, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Duplicate copy of route permit)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.8.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.8', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'If it is required to obtain a duplicate copy
of the route permit owing to the circumstance as re ferred to in Section 88 of
the Act, the owner or manager of motor vehicle conc erned shall make an
application to the concerned Office in the format a s referred to in Schedule-39
and accompanied by the fees as referred to in Schedule-3.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.8.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.8', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'The Office shall, upon making necessary examina tion pursuant to
Section 88 of the Act in relation to the applicatio n made pursuant to Sub-rule', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.8.2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.8', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, ', issue a duplicate copy of the route permit to the applicant and give
information thereof to the concerned police office.', 2, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.9', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '39', 'Application for road test certificate', 'Application for road test certificate', NULL, 9, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Application for road test certificate)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.9.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.9', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'The owner or manager of motor
vehicle who intends to obtain the road test certifi cate pursuant to Section 90 of
the Act shall make an application to the concerned Office in the format as
referred to in Schedule-40 and accompanied by the f ees as referred to in
Schedule-3, for the road test pursuant to Section 9 0 of the Act, prior to
operating the motor vehicle.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.9.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.9', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'If an application is made pursuant to Sub-rule (1), the Office shall
cause the concerned technician to carry out necessa ry test of the concerned
motor vehicle in accordance with the road test desc ription format as referred to
in Schedule-41, and if the details as referred to in the road test description form
appears to be correct, the Office shall issue the r oad test certificate in the
format as referred to in Schedule-42, subject to th e Act and the other
provisions set forth in these Rules.', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.9.2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.9', 3, 'clause', '(3)', '', NULL, 'If, during the validity of the road test certif icate issued pursuant to
Sub-rule (2), any motor vehicle is not found to be in order upon testing it by
the competent authority, transport inspector or con cerned traffic police, such
authority or inspector or police may give a time li mit of Fifteen days for the
necessary repair and maintenance of that motor vehi cle and may give a time
limit of an additional Fifteen days if that time li mit is not sufficient for the
repair and maintenance of the motor vehicle, and it shall be the duty of the
owner or manager of motor vehicle concerned to carr y out repair and
maintenance within that time limit.', 2, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (3)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.9.3', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.9', 3, 'clause', '(4)', '', NULL, 'Such a motor vehicle must not be plied without carrying out its
required repair and maintenance within the time lim it given pursuant to Sub-
rule (3).', 3, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (4)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.10', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '40', 'Requirement of re-road test', 'Requirement of re-road test', NULL, 10, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Requirement of re-road test)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.10.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.10', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'The owner or manager of motor vehicle
shall, pursuant to Section 92 of the Act, make an a pplication to the Office
which has issued the road test certificate, in the format as referred to in
Schedule-43, for re-road test after the expiry of t he period set forth in the road
test certificate issued pursuant to Section 90 of the Act.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.10.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.10', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'If an application is made pursuant to Sub-rule (1) for re-road test, the
Office shall cause necessary test to be conducted p ursuant to Sub-rule (2) of
rule 39 and issue the re-road test certificate, sub ject to the Act and the other
provisions set forth in these Rules.', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.11', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '41', 'Suspension of road test certificate', 'Suspension of road test certificate', NULL, 11, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Suspension of road test certificate)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.11.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.11', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'The owner or manager of motor
vehicle concerned shall make an application, specif ying the reason why the
motor vehicle is not capable of being plied, to the concerned Office, in the
format as referred to in Schedule-44, for the suspe nsion of the road test
certificate, prior to the expiry of the period set forth in the road test certificate
issued pursuant to Sections 91 and 92 of the Act.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.11.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.11', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'If an application is made pursuant to Sub-rule (1) for the suspension
of the road test certificate, the Office shall, if it considers appropriate to
suspend the road test certificate upon making neces sary examination, suspend
it.', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.12', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '42', 'Duplicate copy of road test certificate', 'Duplicate copy of road test certificate', NULL, 12, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Duplicate copy of road test certificate)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.12.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.12', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'If it is required to obtain a
duplicate copy of the road test certificate, the ow ner or manager of motor
vehicle concerned shall make an application to the concerned Office, in the
format as referred to in Schedule-45, accompanied b y the fees as referred to in
Schedule-3, for the duplicate copy of the road test certificate.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.12.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.12', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'If an application is made pursuant to Sub-rule (1) and the Office,
upon making necessary examination in relation to th e application, is of the
opinion that it is necessary to issue a duplicate c opy of the road test certificate
as per the request of the applicant, the Office sha ll issue the duplicate copy of
the road test certificate.', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.13', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '43', 'Road test register', 'Road test register', 'The Office shall maintain a road test certificate register in
the format as referred to in Schedule-46 in order to maintain updated records of
the road test certificates issued, re-road test con ducted and suspension of road
test certificate made pursuant to Sections 91 and 9 2 of the Act and Rules 39,
40 and 41.', 13, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Road test register)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.14', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '44', 'Listing the name of transport service', 'Listing the name of transport service', NULL, 14, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Listing the name of transport service)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.14.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.14', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'The owner or manager of motor
vehicle who intends to operate the transport servic e by listing the name of
transport service pursuant to Section 93 of the Act shall make an application to
the Department, in the format as referred to in Sch edule-47 and accompanied
by the following documents and the fees as referred to in Schedule-3:
(a) Citizenship certificates of the proprietor, par tners or first
directors,
(b) Registration certificates of the motor vehicles under the
transport service intended to be operated,
(c) Where the transport service intended to be oper ated was
operated in any other name previously, the registra tion
certificate, income tax registration certificate an d tax
clearance certificate,
(d) The memorandum of association and articles of
association of the transport service intended to be
operated,
(e) Duplicate copies of appointment letters as refe rred to in
Schedule-62 given to the drivers and conductors ser ving
under the transport service intended to be operated and
description of other employees.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.14.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.14', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'If an application is made pursuant to Sub-rule (1) and the Office,
upon making necessary examination of the applicatio n, finds it appropriate to
list the name of such transport service and issue t he license to operate the
transport service, the Office shall list the transp ort service in the transport
service listing register and issue the license to o perate the transport service, in
the format as referred to in Schedule-48, subject t o the Act and the other
provisions set forth in these Rules.', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.15', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '45', 'Renewal of conductor license', 'Renewal of conductor license', NULL, 15, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Renewal of conductor license)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.15.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.15', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'The owner or manager of motor vehicle
shall make an application to the Department, in the format as referred to in
Schedule-49 and accompanied by the fees as referred to in Schedule-3, for the
renewal of the license to operate transport service, after the expiry of the period
set forth in such a license.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.15.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.15', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'If an application is made pursuant to Sub-rule (1) and the
Department, upon making necessary examination of th e application, finds it
appropriate to renew the license to operate transpo rt service, the Department
shall renew the license to operate transport servic e, subject to the Act and the
other provisions set forth in these Rules.', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.15.2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.15', 3, 'clause', '(3)', '', NULL, 'The Department shall maintain records of the re newal of the license
to operate transport service made pursuant to Sub-r ule (2) in the transport
service register as referred to in Schedule-48.', 2, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (3)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.16', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '46', 'Suspension of license to operate transport serv ice', 'Suspension of license to operate transport serv ice', NULL, 16, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Suspension of license to operate transport serv ice)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.16.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.16', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'If the owner or
manager of a motor vehicle having obtained the lice nse to operate transport
service is not able to operate the transport servic e, the owner or manager shall
make an application, accompanied by the reason for the same, to the
Department, in the format as referred to in Schedul e-37, for approval to
suspend the transport service.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.16.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.16', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'If Department, upon making necessary examination in relation to the
application made pursuant to Sub-rule (1), finds it appropriate to suspend the
license to operate transport service, it shall give approval to suspend the
operation of transport service, in the format as referred to in Schedule-51.', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.16.2', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.16', 3, 'clause', '(3)', '', NULL, 'The contents of the approval given to suspend t he transport service
pursuant to Sub-rule (1) must also be recorded in t he transport service listing
register as referred to in Schedule-48.', 2, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (3)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.16.3', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.16', 3, 'clause', '(4)', '', NULL, 'The owner or manager of motor vehicle concerned may make an
application to the Department, in the format as ref erred to in Schedule-52 and
accompanied by the documents set forth in rule 45 f or a license to re-operate
the suspended transport service within the period s et forth in the license to
operate the transport service which is suspended pursuant to Sub-rule (2).', 3, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (4)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.16.4', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.16', 3, 'clause', '(5)', '', NULL, 'If an application is made pursuant to Sub-rule (1) and the
Department, upon making necessary examination of th e application, finds it
appropriate to operate such transport service, it may issue the license to operate
the transport service, in the format as referred to in Schedule-53, subject to the
Act and the other provisions set forth in these Rul es, and mention the matter in
the transport service register as referred to in Schedule-48.', 4, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (5)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.17', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '47', 'Transmission of license to operate transport servic e', 'Transmission of license to operate transport servic e', 'If the owner or
manager of any motor vehicle having obtained the li cense to operate the
transport service transmits the motor vehicle by wa y of sale of the motor
vehicle to another person or otherwise and the new owner or manager of the
motor vehicle makes an application in the format as referred to in Schedule-54
and accompanied by the documents set forth in Sub-r ule (1) of Rule 45 for the
transmission of the license to operate the transpor t service being used by the
previous owner or manager of the motor vehicle, the Department shall execute
the transmission of such a license.', 17, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Transmission of license to operate transport servic e)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.18', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '48', 'Identity card to be put on by seller of passeng er ticket', 'Identity card to be put on by seller of passeng er ticket', 'The format of the
identity card to be put on by a seller of passenger ticket of the enlisted
transport service operating the public motor vehicl e shall be as referred to in
Schedule-55.', 18, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Identity card to be put on by seller of passeng er ticket)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.19', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '49', 'Format of passenger ticket', 'Format of passenger ticket', 'The format of the passenger ticket of the enlisted
transport service operating the public motor vehicl e shall be as referred to in
Schedule-56.', 19, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Format of passenger ticket)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.20', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '50', 'Bills of carriage of cargo', 'Bills of carriage of cargo', 'The employee of an enlisted transport service
operating a cargo motor vehicle shall receive fares from the owner of cargo
concerned in consideration for the carriage of carg o and issue a bill thereof in
the format as referred to in Schedule-57.', 20, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Bills of carriage of cargo)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.21', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6', 2, 'rule', '51', 'Passenger manifesto', 'Passenger manifesto', NULL, 21, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6 (Passenger manifesto)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.21.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.21', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'The format of passenger manifest to be prepared by
the owner or manager of the enlisted transport serv ice operating on long and
medium routes pursuant to Section 100 of the Act sh all be as referred to in
Schedule-58.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.21.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:6.21', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'The passenger manifesto to be prepared in the f ormat as referred to
in Sub-rule (1) must also include the names of pass engers who get in the motor
vehicle at various stops, in addition to those who are in the motor vehicle at the
time of its departure, and a copy of the passenger manifesto must be given to
each of the police offices and check posts situated at various points of the road.', 1, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-6, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z')
;

