shall be procured as mentioned hereunder:
(a) Upto an amount of One Hundred Thousand Rupees f or an
actual medical expenditure,
(b) At the rate of Five Hundred Rupees for each day of
Hospitalization not exceeding Thirty days to meet t he
waiter and miscellaneous expenditure.
(6) Notwithstanding anything contained elsewhere in this Rule, if the
person associated to the motor vehicle cause to tra vel more passenger than that
of the seat capacity of the vehicle and the passeng er dies or suffers grievous
injury or injury due to an accident of such vehicle ; the owner or the manager of
the vehicle shall have to provide compensation to t he heir of the deceased or
grievously injured or injured person equal to the i nsurance amount as referred
to in this Rule.', 7, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-7', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:7.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:7', 2, 'rule', '54', 'Passenger luggage insurance', 'Passenger luggage insurance', 'The amount of insurance of passenger luggage
shall be as prescribed by the Government of Nepal b y a Notification in the
Nepal Gazette.
24 55. Third party insurance : (1) For the purpose of compensation to be paid for
any death, grievous hurt, hurt or loss of property to be caused due to an
accident of the motor vehicle, the owner or the man ager of the motor vehicle
shall procure an insurance of at least Fifty Hundre d Thousand Rupees for
death, grievous hurt or hurt and another at least F ifty Hundred Thousand
Rupees for the loss of the property.', 0, 'Motor Vehicles and Transport Management Rules, 2054 (1997), Chapter-7 (Passenger luggage insurance)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:7.0.0', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:7.0', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'While procuring insurance pursuant to Sub-rule (1), an insurance of
