  ('doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:7.0.1', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054', 'doc_motor_vehicles_and_transport_management_rules_2054:7.0', 3, 'clause', '(3)', '', NULL, 'In a case, where a third party dies due to an a ccident of the motor
vehicle the owner or the manager of the motor vehic le shall make available an
