  ('doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017:19.14', 'doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017', 'doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017:19', 2, 'rule', '16', 'Causing death of or grievous hurt or injury to any person by running', 'Causing death of or grievous hurt or injury to any person by running', 'over, hitting, blowing or accident by motor vehicle', 14, 'The National Criminal Procedure (Code) Act, 2017, Chapter-26 (Causing death of or grievous hurt or injury to any person by running)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017:19.15', 'doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017', 'doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017:19', 2, 'rule', '17', 'Offence under Section 9A. of the Civil Aviation Act, 2015', 'Offence under Section 9A. of the Civil Aviation Act, 2015', NULL, 15, 'The National Criminal Procedure (Code) Act, 2017, Chapter-26 (Offence under Section 9A. of the Civil Aviation Act, 2015)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017:19.16', 'doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017', 'doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017:19', 2, 'rule', '18', 'Offence under Section 15 of the Press and Publication Act, 2048', 'Offence under Section 15 of the Press and Publication Act, 2048', NULL, 16, 'The National Criminal Procedure (Code) Act, 2017, Chapter-26 (Offence under Section 15 of the Press and Publication Act, 2048)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017:19.17', 'doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017', 'doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017:19', 2, 'rule', '19', 'Offence of forgery or fraud resulted from any offence included in', 'Offence of forgery or fraud resulted from any offence included in', 'this Schedule', 17, 'The National Criminal Procedure (Code) Act, 2017, Chapter-26 (Offence of forgery or fraud resulted from any offence included in)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017:19.18', 'doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017', 'doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017:19', 2, 'rule', '20', 'Any such other offence as may be specified by the law in force to be', 'Any such other offence as may be specified by the law in force to be', 'included in this Schedule', 18, 'The National Criminal Procedure (Code) Act, 2017, Chapter-26 (Any such other offence as may be specified by the law in force to be)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017:19.19', 'doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017', 'doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017:19', 2, 'rule', '21', 'Any such offence as may be included in this Sche dule by the', 'Any such offence as may be included in this Sche dule by the', 'Government of Nepal, by a notification in the Nepal Gazette', 19, 'The National Criminal Procedure (Code) Act, 2017, Chapter-26 (Any such offence as may be included in this Sche dule by the)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017:20', 'doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017', NULL, 1, 'schedule', 'Schedule-2', '', NULL, '(Relating to clauses (d) and (l) of Section 2)
1. Offences under the following Sections of the following Chapter of
the Penal Code:
(a) Sections 107, 108, 109 , 111, 112 and 113 of Chapter-5
of Part-2
2. Any criminal case, which is instituted with the Government of Nepal
being plaintiff, or any offence of criminal nature in which the right,
interest or concern of the Government of Nepal is vested, except that
mentioned in Schedule-1.
3. Such offen ce as may be included by the law in force in this
Schedule.
4. Such offence as may be specified to be tried and adjudicated under
this Schedule, by the Government of Nepal , by a notification in the
Nepal Gazette.
5. Offence of attempt to, abetment of, conspiracy to , any offence under
numbers 1, 2, 3 and 4, and any offence related thereto under Chapter
11.', 20, 'The National Criminal Procedure (Code) Act, 2017, Schedule-2', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017:21', 'doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017', NULL, 1, 'schedule', 'Schedule-3', '', NULL, '(Relating to clause (l) of Section 2)
1. Offences under Chapter-3 of Part-2 of the Penal Code.
2. Any criminal offence in which the Government of Nepal is
concerned or in which the right, interest or concern of any
constitutional body, court or publi c autho rity is vested, other than
that set forth in Schedule-1 or Schedule-2.', 21, 'The National Criminal Procedure (Code) Act, 2017, Schedule-3', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017:22', 'doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017', NULL, 1, 'schedule', 'Schedule-4', '', NULL, '(Relating to part (l) of Section 2)
1. Offences under the following Chapters or under the following
Sections of the following Chapters of the Penal Code:
(a) Part-2:
(1) Chapter-14 except Section 192
(2) Chapter-15
(3) Sections 220, 224, and 226 of Chapter -18 (if a woman
of 18 years of age or above is involved)
(4) Clause (c) of sub -section (3 ) of Section 249, Sections
250 and 252 of Chapter -21 (if any org anization other
than a person or Government of Nepal is plaintiff)
(5) Chapter-25, except clauses (a), (b) and (c) of sub -
section (3) of Section 276, and Section 277
(6) Sections 284, 286 and 287 of Chapter-26 (if a person is
plaintiff)
(b) Chapters-1 and 2 of Part 3
2. Any criminal cases other than those mentioned in Schedule-1, 2 or 3.
3. Any offences of criminal nature which are to be instituted with
persons being plaintiff under the law in force.
4. Offence of incest.
5. Offences of attempt to, abetment of, conspiracy to, any offence under
serial numbers 1, 2 and 3 above and any offences related thereto
under Chapter-11.', 22, 'The National Criminal Procedure (Code) Act, 2017, Schedule-4', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017:23', 'doc_national_criminal_procedure_code_2074_2017', NULL, 1, 'schedule', 'Schedule-5', '', NULL, '(Relating to sub-sections (1) and (7) of Section 4)
Form of First Information Report
Report submitted to ………….
(Name and address of the police office)
To be filled in by the police office:
Registration No.:
Registration date:
1. Name, surname and address of the person making the first
information report or notice:
2. Law or case in respect whereof the information report or notice has
been made:
3. Name, surname and address (including street) of the person who has
committed the offence:
4. Name of father/mother of the person who has committed the offence:
5. Special ide ntifying feature s of the person who has committed the
offence:
6, Details relating to the offence:
(a) The place, date and time where and when the offence
has been committed or is being committed or going to
be committed:
(b) Details of the event relating to the offence:
(c) Nature of the offence and other details related to the
offence:
(d) Proof, evidence related with the offence:
(e) Other details related to the offence:
8. The contents of this report are true and correct ; if proved false , I
shall bear and pay according to law.
