because of disability, or a child,', 22, 'The National Penal (Code) Act, 2017, Chapter-4, Clause (w)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017:4.0.23', 'doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017', 'doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017:4.0', 3, 'clause', '(x)', '', NULL, 'The offence was committed by a person deputed in
