provoked or given threat to the offender,', 2, 'The National Penal (Code) Act, 2017, Chapter-4, Clause (c)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017:4.1.3', 'doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017', 'doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017:4.1', 3, 'clause', '(d)', '', NULL, 'The offence was committ ed instantly as a retaliation
