or any of his or her close relatives,', 3, 'The National Penal (Code) Act, 2017, Chapter-4, Clause (d)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017:4.1.4', 'doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017', 'doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017:4.1', 3, 'clause', '(e)', '', NULL, 'The offender voluntarily confessed the offence or
expressed a remorse therefor,', 4, 'The National Penal (Code) Act, 2017, Chapter-4, Clause (e)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017:4.1.5', 'doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017', 'doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017:4.1', 3, 'clause', '(f)', '', NULL, 'The offender surrendered himself or herself to the
concerned authority,', 5, 'The National Penal (Code) Act, 2017, Chapter-4, Clause (f)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017:4.1.6', 'doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017', 'doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017:4.1', 3, 'clause', '(g)', '', NULL, 'The offender, having confessed the offence committed by
him or her, has already provided or agreed to pay
compensation to the victim,', 6, 'The National Penal (Code) Act, 2017, Chapter-4, Clause (g)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017:4.1.7', 'doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017', 'doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017:4.1', 3, 'clause', '(h)', '', NULL, 'The offender has diminished capacity because of
physical, mental ability or disability,', 7, 'The National Penal (Code) Act, 2017, Chapter-4, Clause (h)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017:4.1.8', 'doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017', 'doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017:4.1', 3, 'clause', '(i)', '', NULL, 'The extent o f loss or harm caused to the victim and the
society being insignificant,', 8, 'The National Penal (Code) Act, 2017, Chapter-4, Clause (i)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017:4.1.9', 'doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017', 'doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017:4.1', 3, 'clause', '(j)', '', NULL, 'The offender rendered assistance in judicial process by
telling the truth to the court,', 9, 'The National Penal (Code) Act, 2017, Chapter-4, Clause (j)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017:4.1.10', 'doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017', 'doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017:4.1', 3, 'clause', '(k)', '', NULL, 'The offender has confessed the guilt and committed not
to commit any criminal offence in the future,', 10, 'The National Penal (Code) Act, 2017, Chapter-4, Clause (k)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017:4.1.11', 'doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017', 'doc_national_penal_code_2074_2017:4.1', 3, 'clause', '(l)', '', NULL, 'The offence was committed under other''s instigation or
pressure.', 11, 'The National Penal (Code) Act, 2017, Chapter-4, Clause (l)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z')
