  ('doc_partnership_act_2020_1964__2020_partnership-act-2020_pdf:1.2', 'doc_partnership_act_2020_1964__2020_partnership-act-2020_pdf', 'doc_partnership_act_2020_1964__2020_partnership-act-2020_pdf:1', 2, 'section', '3', 'Administration of Justice Act, 2048 (1991) 2048- 2-16 (30 May 1991)', 'Administration of Justice Act, 2048 (1991) 2048- 2-16 (30 May 1991)', NULL, 2, 'Partnership Act, 2020 (1964), Section 3 (Administration of Justice Act, 2048 (1991) 2048- 2-16 (30 May 1991))', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_partnership_act_2020_1964__2020_partnership-act-2020_pdf:1.3', 'doc_partnership_act_2020_1964__2020_partnership-act-2020_pdf', 'doc_partnership_act_2020_1964__2020_partnership-act-2020_pdf:1', 2, 'section', '4', 'Republic Strengthening and Some Nepal Laws', 'Republic Strengthening and Some Nepal Laws', 'Amendment Act, 2066 (2010) 1  2066-10-7 (21 Jan 2010) 
 
Act Number 36 of the Year 2020 (1964) 
An Act made to provide for provisions on partnership  
 
Preamble : Whereas it is expedient to provide for legal provis ions on partnership 
for the interest and convenience of general public;  
Now, therefore be it enacted by His Majesty the Kin g Mahendra Bir 
Bikram Shah Dev on the advice and with the consent of the Rastriya Panchayat.', 3, 'Partnership Act, 2020 (1964), Section 4 (Republic Strengthening and Some Nepal Laws)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_partnership_act_2020_1964__2020_partnership-act-2020_pdf:2', 'doc_partnership_act_2020_1964__2020_partnership-act-2020_pdf', NULL, 1, 'chapter', 'Chapter-1', 'Chapter-1', NULL, NULL, 2, 'Partnership Act, 2020 (1964), Chapter-1', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_partnership_act_2020_1964__2020_partnership-act-2020_pdf:2.0', 'doc_partnership_act_2020_1964__2020_partnership-act-2020_pdf', 'doc_partnership_act_2020_1964__2020_partnership-act-2020_pdf:2', 2, 'section', '1', 'Short Title, Extent and Commencement : (1) This Act may be called', 'Short Title, Extent and Commencement', '"Partnership Act, 2020 (1964)".  
(2) This Act shall be extended throughout Nepal.  
(3) This Act shall come into force immediately.  
 
                                                             
1  This Act came into force on 15 Jestha  2065 and "Prasasti" and the word "Kingdom" has been deleted.  
www.lawcommission.gov.np 
2 
www.lawcommission.gov.np', 0, 'Partnership Act, 2020 (1964), Chapter-1, Section 1 (Short Title, Extent and Commencement)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_partnership_act_2020_1964__2020_partnership-act-2020_pdf:2.1', 'doc_partnership_act_2020_1964__2020_partnership-act-2020_pdf', 'doc_partnership_act_2020_1964__2020_partnership-act-2020_pdf:2', 2, 'section', '2', 'Definition :  Unless the subject or context otherwise requires; in this Act;', 'Definition', '(a)  "Business" includes industry, commerce (trade)  profession or 
occupation ( Briti).  
(b)  "Prescribed" or "as prescribed" means prescrib ed or as prescribed in 
this Act or Rules framed hereunder.  
(c)  "Third Party’ ( Unau bayakti ) means any other person other than 
partners in the partnership firm.  
(d)  "Notification" means an order published in the  Nepal Gazette by the 
Government of Nepal.  
2(f) "Concerned Department" means Department of Comm erce for 
commercial matter, Department of Cottage and Rural Industry for 
the matter related to cottage and rural industry an d Department of 
Industry for any other industry.', 1, 'Partnership Act, 2020 (1964), Chapter-1, Section 2 (Definition)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_partnership_act_2020_1964__2020_partnership-act-2020_pdf:2.2', 'doc_partnership_act_2020_1964__2020_partnership-act-2020_pdf', 'doc_partnership_act_2020_1964__2020_partnership-act-2020_pdf:2', 2, 'section', '3', 'Definition of partnership : (1) Any business registered in a record of the', 'Definition of partnership', 'Government of Nepal by the persons who have agreed to share the profit of 
the business carried on by them in a single name un der an agreement 
(Kabuliat ) made with each other which entitles all partners to take part in 
all business for each partner or entitles any of th em for the same on  behalf 
of all others.  
(2) Persons who have entered into an agreement of p artnership shall 
be called "partners" in relation to each partner an d shall be called "firm" in 
a collective form and the name under which their bu siness in carried on is 
called the “name of firm".  
(3) No partnership firm shall be a person except partners.', 2, 'Partnership Act, 2020 (1964), Chapter-1, Section 3 (Definition of partnership)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_partnership_act_2020_1964__2020_partnership-act-2020_pdf:2.3', 'doc_partnership_act_2020_1964__2020_partnership-act-2020_pdf', 'doc_partnership_act_2020_1964__2020_partnership-act-2020_pdf:2', 2, 'section', '4', 'Business carried on by joint family shall not be pa rtnership : If', 'Business carried on by joint family shall not be pa rtnership', 'coparceners of a joint family carry on joint busine ss without entering in to 
                                                             
