decision of or recommendation by the concerned Ministry, Constitutional body or
Secretariat.', 3, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2 (Diplomatic passport)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.4', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2', 2, 'rule', '7', 'Official passport', 'Official passport', 'The Department shall issue an official passport to the officials and
employees travelling abroad in course of government business, study, study visit or
training on nomination from the Government of Nepal, Provincial Government or any
government body, as prescribed, upon request from the concerned body along with the
decision thereof.', 4, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2 (Official passport)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.5', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2', 2, 'rule', '8', 'Service passport', 'Service passport', NULL, 5, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2 (Service passport)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.5.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.5', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'The Department shall issue a service passport to the private assistant
to the ambassador, permanent representative, special representative, consular general and
employees of gazetted level and classless employee upon written request from the Ministry.', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.5.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.5', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'The Department may issue a service passport to a Nepali citizen working as
local employee in the mission upon written request from the Ministry or the mission.', 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.6', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2', 2, 'rule', '9', 'Ordinary p assport', 'Ordinary p assport', NULL, 6, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2 (Ordinary p assport)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.6.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.6', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'The D epartment may issue an o rdinary passport to the Nepali
citizen.', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.6.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.6', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'Other provisions related to ordinary passport shall be as prescribed.', 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.7', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2', 2, 'rule', '10', 'To submit application for passport', 'To submit application for passport', NULL, 7, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2 (To submit application for passport)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.7.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.7', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'The Nepali citizen desiring to have a passport
shall submit an application to the Department, mission or the prescribed body in a
prescribed format enclosing the original or copy of the Nepali citizenship certificate or the
original or copy of the national identity card issued by the Government of Nepal and
documents as prescribed.', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.7.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.7', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'Notwithstanding anything contained in sub -section (1), in case of a minor
Nepali citizen who is below than sixteen years of age, any one from among his or her father,
mother, guardian or curator shall submit an application along with him or her and also
enclosing the documents as prescribed.', 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.7.2', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.7', 3, 'clause', '(3)', '', NULL, 'The department may issue a passport in the name of a minor in the following
conditions even though the application is not submitted by any one from among his or her
father, mother, guardian or curator:-
(a) in case the court issued an order to issue a passport in the name of
such minor, or
(b) in other conditions as prescribed.', 2, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (3)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.7.3', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.7', 3, 'clause', '(4)', '', NULL, 'If the Department considers fit to issue a passport upon inquiry made to the
applications submitted for the passports pursuant to sub -section (1) or (2), shall issue
passports by maintaining a record thereto.', 3, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (4)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.8', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2', 2, 'rule', '11', 'Issuance of a passport', 'Issuance of a passport', NULL, 8, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2 (Issuance of a passport)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.8.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.8', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'The body to which the application is submitted for passport
shall issue the passport maintaining the record thereof.', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.8.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.8', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'The other provisions related to distribution of passport shall be as prescribed.', 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.9', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2', 2, 'rule', '12', 'Not to issue a passport or to withhold passport', 'Not to issue a passport or to withhold passport', NULL, 9, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2 (Not to issue a passport or to withhold passport)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.9.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.9', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'Notwithstanding anything contained
elsewhere in this Act, a passport may not be issued or may be withheld in the name of the
following persons:-
(a) upon receipt of the writ ten request from the investigating authority not to
issue a passport or to withhold a passport in course of the investigation of
the charge of the offence related to passport, immigration, corruption,
money laundering, human trafficking, abduction, narcotic drugs, illegal
transaction of arms and ammunition, organized crime or terrorism,
(b) upon receipt of an order of the Court not to issue a passport or to withhold
a passport in the case subjudice in the court in charge of the offence related
to passport, immigration, corruption, money laundering, human trafficking,
abduction, narcotic drugs, illegal transaction of arms and ammunition,
organized crime or terrorism,
(c) upon serving a sentence upon conviction from the Court in charge of the
offence related to passport, immigration, corruption, money launderi ng,
human trafficking, abduction, narcotic drugs, illegal transaction of arms and
ammunition, organized crime or terrorism,
(d) upon enlisted in black list upon default of payment of the loan of the bank
and financial institution,
(e) upon restriction on travelling abroad or not to issue a passport or to withhold
a passport issued by an order of the Government of Nepal or of the Court
with reasonable grounds,
(f) when a decision has been made as not to issue a passport or withhold
passport specifying the reasons thereof by the body issuing passport,
(g) when valid period of more than one year remains in the passport issued in
the name of the passport holder.', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.9.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.9', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'If the Department does not issue an ordinary passport by the reason as specified
in sub-section (1), it shall provide information thereof to the concerned applicant.', 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.9.2', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.9', 3, 'clause', '(3)', '', NULL, 'In case the court orders to issue a passport or not to withhold it under the
condition of clause (a) of sub-section (1), a passport shall be issued in the name of such a
person.', 2, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (3)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.9.3', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.9', 3, 'clause', '(4)', '', NULL, 'The passport shall be issued in the name of the person if he or she is acquitted
from the Court for the offence pursuant to clause (b) of sub -section (1) or if he or she has
served the sentence in accordance with the law for the offence pursuant to clause (d).', 3, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (4)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.9.4', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.9', 3, 'clause', '(5)', '', NULL, 'A passport may be issued in the name of the person upon receipt of non-
existence of the conditions pursuant to clauses (d), (e) or (f) of sub-section (1) in his or her
regard.', 4, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (5)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.10', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2', 2, 'rule', '13', 'More than one passport may be issued', 'More than one passport may be issued', 'Notwithstanding anything contained elsewhere
in this Act, a new passport may, even though the term of the earlier passport remains valid,
be issued in the following conditions:-', 10, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2 (More than one passport may be issued)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.10.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.10', 3, 'clause', '(a)', '', NULL, 'in case a diplomatic or official passport holder submits an
application for the ordinary passport,', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (a)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.10.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.10', 3, 'clause', '(b)', '', NULL, 'in case an ordinary passport holder submits an application for the
diplomatic or official passport in accordance with the prevailing
laws.', 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (b)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.11', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2', 2, 'rule', '14', 'Passport may be issued even though its valid period remains', 'Passport may be issued even though its valid period remains', 'Notwithstanding
anything contained in clause (g) of s ub-section (1) of Section 12, a new passport may be
issued, even though the term of the passport issued in the name of the passport holder
remains valid for more than one year in the following conditions:-', 11, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2 (Passport may be issued even though its valid period remains)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.11.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.11', 3, 'clause', '(a)', '', NULL, 'in case the passport is not readable being old, tampered, withered or
not being able to use due to error in details thereof,', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (a)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.11.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.11', 3, 'clause', '(b)', '', NULL, 'in case no adequate pages left in the passport,', 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (b)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.11.2', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.11', 3, 'clause', '(c)', '', NULL, 'in case of change of surname,', 2, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (c)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.11.3', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.11', 3, 'clause', '(d)', '', NULL, 'in case the passport prepared by the Department gets lost or
destroyed prior to its distribution to the concerned person,', 3, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (d)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.11.4', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.11', 3, 'clause', '(e)', '', NULL, 'in case the minor intends to have a passport before attaining sixteen
years of age,', 4, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (e)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.11.5', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.11', 3, 'clause', '(f)', '', NULL, 'in case the passport has been issued in special circumstance,', 5, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (f)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.11.6', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.11', 3, 'clause', '(g)', '', NULL, 'in other conditions as prescribed.', 6, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (g)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.12', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2', 2, 'rule', '15', 'Passport may be cancelled', 'Passport may be cancelled', NULL, 12, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2 (Passport may be cancelled)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.12.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.12', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'The Department may cancel the passport in the following
conditions:-
(a) in case the passport holder informs the Department or the mission
about the lost passport issued in his or her name,
(b) in case the passport is cancelled or revoked by the order of the Court,
(c) in case the passport holder no longer remains a Nepali citizen,
(d) in case it is proved that the non -Nepali citizen has received the
passport,
(e) in case the passport is received by providing false details,
(f) in case the applicant does not receive the passport within the
prescribed time after submitting the application.', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.12.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.12', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'The Department shall provide information of cancellation of the passport
pursuant to clauses (a), (b), (c), (d) and (e ) of sub-section (1) to the concerned body of the
Government of Nepal, foreign missions located in Nepal and office of the Interpol located
in Nepal.', 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.12.2', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.12', 3, 'clause', '(3)', '', NULL, 'If any Nepali citizen submits an application in the mission for a new passport
upon lost of his or her passport in the foreign country, the mission shall writ it to the
Department to cancel such a passport specifying all the details of the passport holder and
the passport number and such information shall also be provided to the Immigration office
at Nepal, Ministry responsible for foreign affairs of the country w here the concerned
mission is located and the foreign missions in that country.', 2, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (3)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.13', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2', 2, 'rule', '16', 'To use passport', 'To use passport', NULL, 13, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2 (To use passport)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.13.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.13', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'The provisions on use of diplomatic and official passports shall be as
prescribed.', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:2.13.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:2.13', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'The holder of the diplomatic or official passport shall have to return such
passport to the Department after the completion of the purpose pursuant to sub-section (1).
Provided that the person bearing the prescribed public post may keep the diplomatic
or special passport with himself or herself up to the term as prescribed.', 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-2, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:3', 'doc_passport_act_2076', NULL, 1, 'chapter', 'Chapter-3', '', NULL, 'Regarding Travel Document and Seamans Record Book', 3, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-3', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:3.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:3', 2, 'rule', '17', 'Travel document', 'Travel document', NULL, 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-3 (Travel document)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:3.0.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:3.0', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'The Department and mission may issue a travel document.', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-3, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:3.0.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:3.0', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'The terms and conditions for issuance of a travel document to be issued
pursuant to sub-section (1) shall be as prescribed.', 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-3, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:3.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:3', 2, 'rule', '18', 'Seamans passport', 'Seamans passport', NULL, 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-3 (Seamans passport)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:3.1.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:3.1', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'The Department or the mission may issue seamans passport to the
Nepali citizen who is going to work in ships.', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-3, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:3.1.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:3.1', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'If an ordinary passport holder s ubmits an application for seamans passport to
the Department or mission enclosing the prescribed documents for the purpose of working
in ships, the Department or mission shall issue seamans passport subject to the prescribed
terms.', 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-3, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:4', 'doc_passport_act_2076', NULL, 1, 'chapter', 'Chapter-4', '', NULL, 'Regarding Passport to be Issued in Temporary and Special Condition', 4, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-4', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:4.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:4', 2, 'rule', '19', 'Temporary passport may be issued', 'Temporary passport may be issued', 'The Mission may issue a temporary passport to the
Nepali citizen residing abroad if he or she submits an application for a new passport for
expiry of the valid term of the passport, lost, destroyed or by the reason of passport not
being able to use being tempered, for a period not exceeding nine months till the issuance
of a new passport.', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-4 (Temporary passport may be issued)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:4.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:4', 2, 'rule', '20', 'Passport to be issued in special condition', 'Passport to be issued in special condition', NULL, 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-4 (Passport to be issued in special condition)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:4.1.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:4.1', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'In case any minor son or daughter of the
Nepali citizen resides abroad and has not acquired certificate of Nepali citizenship attaining
sixteen years of age, submits an application enclosing prescribed documents along with the
evidence that he or she has not acquired foreign citizenship or applied for the certificate of
foreign citizenship, the mission may issue the ordinary passport in his or her name for a
period not exceeding two years term for once.
Provided that the mission may issue the ordinary passport for him or her for
additional two years term if he or she submits an application specifying the reason for not
being able to acquire the certificate of Nepali citizenship as a result of force majeure.', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-4, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:4.1.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:4.1', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'Such passport holder shall have to receive the ordinary passport by acquiring
the certificate of Nepali citizenship within the period pursuant to sub-section (1).', 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-4, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:5', 'doc_passport_act_2076', NULL, 1, 'chapter', 'Chapter-5', '', NULL, 'Regarding Offence and Punishment', 5, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-5', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:5.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:5', 2, 'rule', '21', 'Offence', 'Offence', 'If any one commits, cause to commit or abet the commission of any of the
following acts shall be considered as commission of an offence pursuant to this Act:-', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-5 (Offence)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:5.0.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:5.0', 3, 'clause', '(a)', '', NULL, 'receives or attempts to receive a passport or travel document submitting false
details,', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-5, Clause (a)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:5.0.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:5.0', 3, 'clause', '(b)', '', NULL, 'visits or attempts to visit a foreign country without having a passport or travel
document pursuant to this Act,', 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-5, Clause (b)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:5.0.2', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:5.0', 3, 'clause', '(c)', '', NULL, 'fails to abide by the order or direction issued by the Government of Nepal,', 2, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-5, Clause (c)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:5.0.3', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:5.0', 3, 'clause', '(d)', '', NULL, 'uses the passport for the purpose other than the purpose for which it is issued,', 3, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-5, Clause (d)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:5.0.4', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:5.0', 3, 'clause', '(e)', '', NULL, 'provides own passport for the use to other or uses other''s passport,', 4, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-5, Clause (e)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:5.0.5', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:5.0', 3, 'clause', '(f)', '', NULL, 'corrects photo or details in the passport,', 5, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-5, Clause (f)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:5.0.6', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:5.0', 3, 'clause', '(g)', '', NULL, 'holds in controls other person''s passport without his or her consent and with
malafide intention,', 6, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-5, Clause (g)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:5.0.7', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:5.0', 3, 'clause', '(h)', '', NULL, 'performs any other act in contrary to this Act and the Rules framed under this
Act.', 7, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-5, Clause (h)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:5.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:5', 2, 'rule', '22', 'Punishment', 'Punishment', NULL, 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-5 (Punishment)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:5.1.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:5.1', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'Anyone who commits the offence pursuant to clause (a), (b), (c), (d),
(e)or (g) of section 21 shall be liable to the punishment with fine of two lakh rupees to five
lakh rupees or with an imprisonment of one year to three years or with both.', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-5, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:5.1.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:5.1', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'Anyone who commits the offence by committing any act contrary to this Act
and the Rules framed under this Act other than those referred to in sub-section (1) shall be
liable to the punishment with fine of fifty thousand rupees to one lakh rupees or with
imprisonment of six months to one year or with both.', 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-5, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:5.1.2', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:5.1', 3, 'clause', '(3)', '', NULL, 'If anyon e who orders or abets to commit any offence shall be liable to the
punishment as an offender referred to in sub-sections (1) and (2) and the accomplice to
such an offence shall be liable to the half of the punishment imposed to the offender.', 2, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-5, Clause (3)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:5.2', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:5', 2, 'rule', '23', 'No obstruction to take action in accordance with prevailing laws', 'No obstruction to take action in accordance with prevailing laws', 'If any act to be
considered as an offence under this Act is also considered as offence under other prevailing
laws, nothing contained in this Act shall hinder to take action instituting the case under
prevailing laws in respect to such an offence.', 2, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-5 (No obstruction to take action in accordance with prevailing laws)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6', 'doc_passport_act_2076', NULL, 1, 'chapter', 'Chapter-6', '', NULL, 'Miscellaneous', 6, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6', 2, 'rule', '24', 'Colour, Format and Size of Passport', 'Colour, Format and Size of Passport', 'The colour, format and size of the passport to be
issued pursuant to Sections 5, 17, 18, 19 and 20 shall be as prescribed.', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6 (Colour, Format and Size of Passport)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6', 2, 'rule', '25', 'Fees', 'Fees', NULL, 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6 (Fees)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.1.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6.1', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'No fees shall be imposed to issue diplomatic, official or service passport.', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.1.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6.1', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'The fees as prescribed, shall be imposed to issue ordinary passport, travel
document, seamans passport, temporary passport and passport to be issued in special
conditions.', 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.2', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6', 2, 'rule', '26', 'Passport may be returned', 'Passport may be returned', NULL, 2, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6 (Passport may be returned)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.2.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6.2', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'The ordinary passport holder may return the passp ort
issued in his or her name to the Department if it is not required by him or her or he or she
is not in a situation to keep the passport with him or her because of any other reason thereto.', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.2.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6.2', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'The Department shall cancel the passport returned pursuant to sub-section (1).', 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.3', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6', 2, 'rule', '27', 'Electronic Record and Personalization', 'Electronic Record and Personalization', NULL, 3, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6 (Electronic Record and Personalization)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.3.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6.3', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'The Department shall conduct the act of
passport personalization by processing the personal details of the applicant certified by the
concerned body and received with the applicati on for the passport also with the means of
technology.', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.3.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6.3', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'The Department shall prepare and place securely the electronic record of
passports, travel documents and seamans passports in a format as prescribed.', 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.3.2', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6.3', 3, 'clause', '(3)', '', NULL, 'The details of the travel documents and seamans passports issued by the mission
shall be sent to the Department in each three months.', 2, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6, Clause (3)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.4', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6', 2, 'rule', '28', 'To keep documents safe', 'To keep documents safe', NULL, 4, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6 (To keep documents safe)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.4.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6.4', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'The application filed for passport and also other documents
enclosed shall be kept safely for twelve years from the date of issuance of the passport.', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.4.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6.4', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'The Department shall dispose the passports cancelled pursuant to this Act as
prescribed.', 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.4.2', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6.4', 3, 'clause', '(3)', '', NULL, 'The disposal procedure of the documents pursuant to sub-section (1) shall be in
accordance with the prevailing laws.', 2, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6, Clause (3)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.5', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6', 2, 'rule', '29', 'Government to be Plaintiff', 'Government to be Plaintiff', 'The Government of Nepal shall be a plaintiff in the case of
offence punishable under this Act and such cases shall be deemed to be included in the
Schedule-1 of the National Criminal Procedure Code, 2017 (2074).', 5, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6 (Government to be Plaintiff)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.6', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6', 2, 'rule', '30', 'Appeal', 'Appeal', 'A person not satisfying with the decision of the Department for rejecting to issue
the passport or cancel the passport may file an appeal in the High Court of the province
where the Department is situated within thirty five days of the receipt of informatio n of
such rejection or cancellation.', 6, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6 (Appeal)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.7', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6', 2, 'rule', '31', 'Delegation of Power', 'Delegation of Power', 'The Department may delegate some of its power s, obtained by it
under this Act, to other body or official as required.', 7, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6 (Delegation of Power)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.8', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6', 2, 'rule', '32', 'Saving of the act done in good faith', 'Saving of the act done in good faith', 'No employee shall be personally liable for the act
done in good faith under this Act.
Provided that the provision of this Section shall not be considered to have been
hindered to take any legal action to the consequence arising from the act done with
negligence.', 8, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6 (Saving of the act done in good faith)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.9', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6', 2, 'rule', '33', 'Rules may be framed', 'Rules may be framed', 'The Gover nment of Nepal may frame necessary Rules to
implement this Act.', 9, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6 (Rules may be framed)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.10', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6', 2, 'rule', '34', 'Procedure may be framed', 'Procedure may be framed', 'The Ministry may frame necessary Procedure s without
prejudice to the objective of the Act.', 10, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6 (Procedure may be framed)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.11', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6', 2, 'rule', '35', 'Repeal and Saving', 'Repeal and Saving', NULL, 11, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6 (Repeal and Saving)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.11.0', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6.11', 3, 'clause', '(1)', '', NULL, 'Passport Act, 1976 (2024) has been hereby repealed.', 0, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6, Clause (1)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_passport_act_2076:6.11.1', 'doc_passport_act_2076', 'doc_passport_act_2076:6.11', 3, 'clause', '(2)', '', NULL, 'The acts performed in accordance with the Passport Act, 1976 (2024) shall be
considered to have been performed in accordance with this Act.', 1, 'Passport Act, 2076 (2019), Chapter-6, Clause (2)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z')
;

