(2) These Rules shall come into force immediately.', 0, 'Police Rules, 2049 (1992), Chapter - 1, Section 1 (Short title and commencement)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_police_rules_2049_1992__2049_nepal_poliru_pdf:2.1', 'doc_police_rules_2049_1992__2049_nepal_poliru_pdf', 'doc_police_rules_2049_1992__2049_nepal_poliru_pdf:2', 2, 'section', '2', 'Definitions : Unless the subject or the context otherwise requir es, in', 'Definitions', 'this Rules,- 
