  ('doc_police_rules_2049_1992__2049_nepal_poliru_pdf:16.12', 'doc_police_rules_2049_1992__2049_nepal_poliru_pdf', 'doc_police_rules_2049_1992__2049_nepal_poliru_pdf:16', 2, 'section', '165', 'To maintain sheet rolls : (1) The appointing authority shall establish', 'To maintain sheet rolls', 'Two copies of sheet rolls of each Police employee. 
(2) A copy of the sheet rolls established pursuant to Sub-rule (1) 
has to be sent to the Records Keeping Office. The o ther copy has to be 
maintained with the office where the employee is in  service, and the 
copy so maintained has to be sent to the office whe re the employee is 
transferred if the employee is transferred elsewhere.', 12, 'Police Rules, 2049 (1992), Chapter-15, Section 165 (To maintain sheet rolls)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_police_rules_2049_1992__2049_nepal_poliru_pdf:16.13', 'doc_police_rules_2049_1992__2049_nepal_poliru_pdf', 'doc_police_rules_2049_1992__2049_nepal_poliru_pdf:16', 2, 'section', '166', 'Employee''s Provident Fund : By deducting the amount at the rate of', 'Employee''s Provident Fund', 'ten per cent from the monthly salary of each Police  employee and 
