frame and enforce  necessary guidelines , procedures and standards.', 7, 'The Environment Protection Act, 2019 (2076), Chapter -7, Section 45 (Power to frame guidelines , procedures and standards)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_environment_protection_act_2019_2076__2019_the-environment-protection-act-2019-2076_2021-12-03_06-38-31_pd:7.8', 'doc_the_environment_protection_act_2019_2076__2019_the-environment-protection-act-2019-2076_2021-12-03_06-38-31_pd', 'doc_the_environment_protection_act_2019_2076__2019_the-environment-protection-act-2019-2076_2021-12-03_06-38-31_pd:7', 2, 'section', '46', 'Assessment as to implementation of the Act:  (1) The Ministry shall make', 'Assessment as to implementation of the Act', 'assessment of impacts of the impl ementation of the Act.', 8, 'The Environment Protection Act, 2019 (2076), Chapter -7, Section 46 (Assessment as to implementation of the Act)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_environment_protection_act_2019_2076__2019_the-environment-protection-act-2019-2076_2021-12-03_06-38-31_pd:7.9', 'doc_the_environment_protection_act_2019_2076__2019_the-environment-protection-act-2019-2076_2021-12-03_06-38-31_pd', 'doc_the_environment_protection_act_2019_2076__2019_the-environment-protection-act-2019-2076_2021-12-03_06-38-31_pd:7', 2, 'section', '47', 'Repeal and saving: (1) The Environment Protection Act, 1997 (2053) is hereby', 'Repeal and saving', 'repealed.  
