  ('doc_the_foreign_investment_and_technology_transfer_act_2019_2075__2019_fitta-2075_pdf:4.1', 'doc_the_foreign_investment_and_technology_transfer_act_2019_2075__2019_fitta-2075_pdf', 'doc_the_foreign_investment_and_technology_transfer_act_2019_2075__2019_fitta-2075_pdf:4', 2, 'section', '22', 'Functions , duties and powers of the Department : In addition to the functions ,', 'Functions , duties and powers of the Department', 'duties and powers referred to,  elsewhere in this Act, other functions , duties and 
