  ('doc_the_foreign_investment_and_technology_transfer_act_2019_2075__2019_fitta-2075_pdf:4.2', 'doc_the_foreign_investment_and_technology_transfer_act_2019_2075__2019_fitta-2075_pdf', 'doc_the_foreign_investment_and_technology_transfer_act_2019_2075__2019_fitta-2075_pdf:4', 2, 'section', '23', 'Services to be provided through the Single Stop Service Centre: (1) T he', 'Services to be provided through the Single Stop Service Centre', 'Government of Nepal may make necessary arrangement so that exemptions , 
