  ('doc_the_foreign_investment_and_technology_transfer_act_2019_2075__2019_fitta-2075_pdf:5.3', 'doc_the_foreign_investment_and_technology_transfer_act_2019_2075__2019_fitta-2075_pdf', 'doc_the_foreign_investment_and_technology_transfer_act_2019_2075__2019_fitta-2075_pdf:5', 2, 'section', '27', 'Provision relating to exp erts, top-level technical and managerial', 'Provision relating to exp erts, top-level technical and managerial', 'employee s: (1) An industry with foreign investment shall  fulfill the positions of 
