(7) Other provisions relating to visa facility shall be as  prescribed.', 6, 'The Foreign Investment and Technology Transfer Act, 2019 (2075), Chapter -5, Section 30 (Provision relating to visa facilit y)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_foreign_investment_and_technology_transfer_act_2019_2075__2019_fitta-2075_pdf:5.7', 'doc_the_foreign_investment_and_technology_transfer_act_2019_2075__2019_fitta-2075_pdf', 'doc_the_foreign_investment_and_technology_transfer_act_2019_2075__2019_fitta-2075_pdf:5', 2, 'section', '31', 'Provisions relating to land:  (1) A  foreign investor sh all have to manage such', 'Provisions relating to land', 'land a s may be required for the industry , by purchasing it on his or her own or 
