(3) Other provisions relating to foreign investment in an industry 
registered in a Province  shall be as prescribed .', 10, 'The Foreign Investment and Technology Transfer Act, 2019 (2075), Chapter 7, Section 48 (Foreign investment in any industry register ed in Province)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
