  ('doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf:4.1', 'doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf', 'doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf:4', 2, 'section', '8', 'Upper ceiling of land allowed to be owned as tenant:', 'Upper ceiling of land allowed to be owned as tenant', '(1) Any person or his family may, as a tenant, till the land not exceeding
the following ceiling:
(a) All Terai regions including inner Terai -4 Bigaha
(b) Kathmandu Valley -10 Ropani
(c) All hilly regions except Kathmandu Valley -20 Ropani
(2) Notwithstanding anything contained in Sub-section (1), where a
