  ('doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf:4.2', 'doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf', 'doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf:4', 2, 'section', '9', 'Provisions relating to land owned in any other name:', 'Provisions relating to land owned in any other name', '(1) If any person or his/her family has, with the intention of possessing by
him/herself, transferred his land or otherwise conveyed his/her title
thereto to another person or if any person obtains any land in the name
of another person by any means and possesses such land on his/her
own directly or indirectly, Section 7 shall apply as if such land were
also owned by him/herself.
