such loan or interest thereof.', 6, 'The Lands Act, 2021(1964), Chapter -9, Section 48 (Provisions relating to recovered loan)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf:10.7', 'doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf', 'doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf:10', 2, 'section', '49', 'Prohibition on getting return of oxen or other tools used in', 'Prohibition on getting return of oxen or other tools used in', 'cultivation:
