  ('doc_the_patent_design_and_trade_mark_act_2022_1965__2022_patent_and_design_act_pdf:1.1', 'doc_the_patent_design_and_trade_mark_act_2022_1965__2022_patent_and_design_act_pdf', 'doc_the_patent_design_and_trade_mark_act_2022_1965__2022_patent_and_design_act_pdf:1', 2, 'section', '2', 'Act Made to Amend Some Nepal Acts Relating to Export and Import', 'Act Made to Amend Some Nepal Acts Relating to Export and Import', 'and Intellectual Property, 2063 (2006) 2063.8.8 (November 24, 2006) 
Preamble: Whereas it is necessary to update the legal arrangements in respect to 
patents, designs and trade-marks for the convenience and economic benefit of the 
general Public, 
Be it enacted by, His Majesty King Mahendra Bir Bikram Shah Dev on the aid and 
advice of the National Panchayat.', 1, 'The Patent, Design and Trade Mark Act, 2022 (1965), Section 2 (Act Made to Amend Some Nepal Acts Relating to Export and Import)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_patent_design_and_trade_mark_act_2022_1965__2022_patent_and_design_act_pdf:2', 'doc_the_patent_design_and_trade_mark_act_2022_1965__2022_patent_and_design_act_pdf', NULL, 1, 'chapter', 'Chapter 1', 'Chapter 1', NULL, NULL, 2, 'The Patent, Design and Trade Mark Act, 2022 (1965), Chapter 1', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
