Schedule-2.', 12, 'The Public Procurement Regulation, 2064 ( 2007), Chapter -2, Section 15 (Cost estimate to be updated)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:4', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', NULL, 1, 'chapter', 'Chapter-3', 'Chapter-3', NULL, NULL, 4, 'The Public Procurement Regulation, 2064 ( 2007), Chapter-3', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:4.0', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:4', 2, 'section', '17', 'Goods manufactured in Nepal to be procured : A public entity  shall, in', 'Goods manufactured in Nepal to be procured', 'making procur ement by selecting any method set forth  in this 
