18.27 Provision s relating to p reparation of standing list: (1) A person, 
organization, supplier, construction entrepreneur, consultant, non -
governmental organization or service provider  that wishes to get 
registered or updated in the standing list pursuant to Section 6A. of 
the Act shall make an application in the form referred to in Schedule -
2A., accompanied by the copies of the following documents, to the 
