(3) The p rocurement contract shall be governed by the 
provisions of this Regulation to the extent provided for in this 
Regulation and by the prevai ling law on the s ale of goods contract 
with regard to  the matters not provided  for in this Regulation.  
(4) The procurement contract of goods or the conditions of 
