  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:4.4', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:4', 2, 'section', '22', 'Procurement contract for construction works: A public entity  may, for', 'Procurement contract for construction works', 'the execut ion of  any construction work, enter into any one  contract 
out of the contracts referred to  in Schedule -4.', 4, 'The Public Procurement Regulation, 2064 ( 2007), Chapter-3, Section 22 (Procurement contract for construction works)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:4.5', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:4', 2, 'section', '23', 'Procurement contract for consulta ncy services : A public entity  may,', 'Procurement contract for consulta ncy services', 'for the  procure ment of  a consultancy service, enter into  any one  
contract out of the contract s referred to  in Schedule -5.  
24.36 Conditions may be specified : If it is required to specify any other 
