  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6.4', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6', 2, 'section', '35', 'Selection of qualified applicant s: (1) The evaluat ion committee shall', 'Selection of qualified applicant s', 'make necessary examination as to whether an applicant for pre -
