  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6.5', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6', 2, 'section', '36', 'Report to be submitted : (1) The evaluation committee shall,  within', 'Report to be submitted', 'fifteen days of the date on which it opened the proposals ,56 prepare 
