  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6.6', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6', 2, 'section', '37', 'Matters to be specified in bidding documents : The public entity  may,', 'Matters to be specified in bidding documents', 'in addition to the matters referred to in Section 13 of the Act, specify 
