Procurement Monitoring Office.', 6, 'The Public Procurement Regulation, 2064 ( 2007), Chapter -5, Section 37 (Matters to be specified in bidding documents)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6.7', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6', 2, 'section', '38', 'Prohibition of d iscrimination : (1) Except in the c ircumstance s set', 'Prohibition of d iscrimination', 'forth in clause (h) of sub-section (2) of Section 13  and sub -section (8) 
of Section 14 58 of the Act, no p ublic entity  shall discriminate among 
