divergency between such document s or prin ted materials and  such 
translated portion, the translated portion shall prevail.', 10, 'The Public Procurement Regulation, 2064 ( 2007), Chapter -5, Section 41 (Language of bid)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6.11', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6', 2, 'section', '42', 'Matters to be specified in technical specifications of goods: In', 'Matters to be specified in technical specifications of goods', 'specifying the technical specifications of goods in the bidding 
