  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6.12', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6', 2, 'section', '43', 'Matters to be specified in technical specifications of', 'Matters to be specified in technical specifications of', 'construction works: In specifying the technical specifications of 
a construction work in the bidding documents, the public entity  
shall, as required,  specify the following matters:  
