(m) Schedule of time for commencing and completing  
the construction work, and  
(n) Such o ther necessary matters as specified by the 
concerned public entity .', 12, 'The Public Procurement Regulation, 2064 ( 2007), Chapter -5, Section 43 (Matters to be specified in technical specifications of)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6.13', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6', 2, 'section', '44', 'Matters to be specified in specifications of other services : In', 'Matters to be specified in specifications of other services', 'specifying the technical specifications of other services in the bidding 
