  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6.15', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6', 2, 'section', '46', 'Instruction to prepare and submit bids: (1) ……67 A public entity  may,', 'Instruction to prepare and submit bids', 'in providing instructions in the bidding documents for preparing and 
