  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6.17', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6', 2, 'section', '48', 'Fees for bidding documents : (1) A  person , firm, organization or', 'Fees for bidding documents', 'company  wishing to purchase bidding documents shall obtain the 
