service with the cost estimate of up to on  one 
hundred million  rupees, 
(b) One hundred and twenty days f or a bid or proposal 
of a consultancy service with the cost estimate 
whatsoever exceeding one hundred million rupees. 
54A. 81……..', 22, 'The Public Procurement Regulation, 2064 ( 2007), Chapter -5, Section 54 (Validity period of bid)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6.23', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6', 2, 'section', '55', 'Necessary copies of bid to be submitted : In submitting a pre -', 'Necessary copies of bid to be submitted', 'qualification proposal, bid or proposal for a consultancy service, a 
