copies of the bid or proposal as required.', 23, 'The Public Procurement Regulation, 2064 ( 2007), Chapter -5, Section 55 (Necessary copies of bid to be submitted)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6.24', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6', 2, 'section', '56', 'Register to be maintained and receipt to be given: (1) A public entity', 'Register to be maintained and receipt to be given', 'shall separately maintain the records of sale and registration of the 
