  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6.27', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:6', 2, 'section', '60', 'Examination of completeness of bids: The evaluation committee shall,', 'Examination of completeness of bids', 'in examining the completeness of a bid, examin e the following 
