report etc. to be submitted by the consultant.', 0, 'The Public Procurement Regulation, 2064 ( 2007), Chapter -6, Section 69 (Terms of reference to be p repared)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:7.1', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:7', 2, 'section', '70', 'Short list to be prepared by inviting open expression of intent: (1) A', 'Short list to be prepared by inviting open expression of intent', 'public entity shall, in order t o procure a consultancy service  the cost 
