  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:7.2', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:7', 2, 'section', '71', 'Invitation to p roposal s: (1) Once a short list has been prepared', 'Invitation to p roposal s', 'pursuant to Rule 70, the p ublic entity  shall invite proposal s from the 
intent expressing proponents included in that list by sending them the 
documents relating to proposal by post, courier or in person or 
through electronic communication means, giving  the time of at least 
fifteen days in the case of procurement of which cost estimate does 
