  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:7.3', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:7', 2, 'section', '72', 'Consultancy s ervice may be procured  by inviting p roposal s from', 'Consultancy s ervice may be procured  by inviting p roposal s from', 'consultants in the standing l ist: (1) A public entity  may procure a 
