method.', 3, 'The Public Procurement Regulation, 2064 ( 2007), Chapter -6, Section 72 (Consultancy s ervice may be procured  by inviting p roposal s from)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:7.4', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:7', 2, 'section', '73', 'Matters to be specified in instructions to prepare p roposal s: The', 'Matters to be specified in instructions to prepare p roposal s', 'public entity  shall specify the following matters in the instructions to 
be given to prepare proposal s pursuant to clause (c) of s ub-section (2) 
of Section 31 of the Act:  
(a) Format of technical and financial proposal s,  
(b) Method of preparing and submitting technical and 
financial proposal s,  
(c) Number of the stages at which the work is to be 
