(6)144 In requiring the security for the sealed quotation, the 
public entity shall, subject to the ceiling of two to three percen t 
amount of the approved cost estimate, specify a certain amount and 
set out the amount of security in the notice inviting sealed quotations. 
A person , firm, organization or company who submits  the sealed 
quotation shall submit , along with the sealed quota tion, such security 
in cash or in the form of such a bank guarantee with the validity 
