(7) The validity period of the  sealed quotati on shall be of 
forty-five days.  
(8) The public entity  shall open the sealed quotation form s 
immediately after the expiry of the deadline for submission of  sealed 
quotation s at the place specified in the notice inviting sealed 
quotation s in the presence of the sealed q uotation bidders  or their 
