  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:11.1', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:11', 2, 'section', '101', '189 Ceiling  of the amount: (1) For the purpose of s ub-section (8) of', '189 Ceiling  of the amount', 'Section 47 of the Act, no application may be made to the review 
