  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:11.2', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:11', 2, 'section', '102', '191 Details to b e s ubmitted : The chairperson and member of the', '191 Details to b e s ubmitted', 'review c ommittee shall  submit to the Office of the Prime Minister and 
