  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:11.3', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:11', 2, 'section', '103', 'Matters to be set out in application to be made for r eview….192: (1) A', 'Matters to be set out in application to be made for r eview….192', 'bidder or proponent who wishes  to make  an application  for review 
