  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:11.5', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:11', 2, 'section', '105', 'Method of sending application for r eview: (1) A bidder or proponent', 'Method of sending application for r eview', 'may himself or herself deliver or send by post, courier service or 
electronic means the application to be made for review to the chief of 
public entity  or review c ommittee.  
(2) If the application sent by post, courier serv ice o r 
