Regulation, no action shall be taken upon such an application.  
(3)196 Upon receipt of the application for review pursuant to 
sub-rule (1), the public entity shall withhold the procurement contract 
until decision is made by the review committee.', 5, 'The Public Procurement Regulation, 2064 ( 2007), Chapter -10, Section 105 (Method of sending application for r eview)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:11.6', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:11', 2, 'section', '106', 'Matters to be stated in information and c omments : (1) The', 'Matters to be stated in information and c omments', 'information and comments to be given by a public entity  pursuant to 
