  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:11.7', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:11', 2, 'section', '107', 'Hearing concerning r eview: (1) The review c ommittee may, if it', 'Hearing concerning r eview', 'conside rs necessary to inquire into both the applicant and the 
