  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:12.18', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:12', 2, 'section', '127', 'Payment to be m ade in case of t ermination of procurement c ontract on', 'Payment to be m ade in case of t ermination of procurement c ontract on', 'ground of convenience : (1) Where the p ublic entity  has terminated the 
