  ('doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:13.2', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf', 'doc_the_public_procurement_regulation_2064_2007__2008_public_procurement_rules_2064_pdf:13', 2, 'section', '138', 'Consultant to avoid conflict of interest : (1) The consultant shall', 'Consultant to avoid conflict of interest', 'provide professional, objective and impartial consultancy service in a 
