complet ing the work as to serve the best interest s of the concerned 
public entity , he or she may not be appointed as a consultant.  
Example : A consultant who is appointed for the preparation of 
engineering design of a project cannot be appointed as a consultant 
for environmental assessment  of the same project or a consultant 
relating to privatization of any government owned body cannot be 
appointed as a consultant of the person pur chasing such property nor 
