concerned Ministry or central entity.  
184 
 
(d) For the purpose of approval of the cost estimate of a 
project/program and selection of the procurement method, the 
total cost estimate shall be found out by adding value -added tax 
and various contingencies to the addition (a).  
  
185 
 
