  ('doc_the_social_security_act_2075_2018_2075_the_social_security_act_20:3.4', 'doc_the_social_security_act_2075_2018_2075_the_social_security_act_20', 'doc_the_social_security_act_2075_2018_2075_the_social_security_act_20:3', 2, 'section', '25', 'Punish imposable under the prevailing law: In cases where any act deemed to be an', 'Punish imposable under the prevailing law', 'offence under this Act is also deemed to be an offence under the prevailing law, nothing
