  ('doc_the_social_security_act_2075_2018_2075_the_social_security_act_20:4.1', 'doc_the_social_security_act_2075_2018_2075_the_social_security_act_20', 'doc_the_social_security_act_2075_2018_2075_the_social_security_act_20:4', 2, 'section', '27', 'Power to establish care center: The Government of Nepal, Provincial Government or', 'Power to establish care center', 'Local Level may establish and operate care centers, as prescribed, for taking care of the
